Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.69,0:01:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,为阻止动荡局势进一步恶化\N{\fnArial\fs30}"In order to affect a timely halt to deteriorating conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.37,0:01:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了百姓大众的利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to ensure the common good,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,该地处于警戒状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}a state of emergency is declared for these territories.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.47,0:01:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝克特勋爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}by decree of Lord Cutler Beckett,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.17,0:01:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,被皇帝陛下委派至此\N{\fnArial\fs30}duly appointed representative of His Majesty, the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.55,0:01:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据宵禁法\N{\fnArial\fs30}By decree, according to martial law,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对以下法规做出暂时修订\N{\fnArial\fs30}the following statutes are temporarily amended:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,公共聚众权 被剥夺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right to assembly, suspended.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.79,0:01:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,人身保护权 被剥夺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right to habeas corpus, suspended.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.46,0:01:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,法律咨询权 被剥夺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right to legal counsel, suspended.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.60,0:01:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,陪审团议罪权 被剥夺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right to verdict by a jury of peers, suspended.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,法令规定 凡定罪为海盗者\N{\fnArial\fs30}By decree, all persons found guilty of piracy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.28,0:01:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,协助海盗者\N{\fnArial\fs30}or aiding a person convicted of piracy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.48,0:01:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,与海盗有瓜葛者\N{\fnArial\fs30}or associating with a person convicted of piracy…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.49,0:01:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,将处以绞刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}…shall be sentenced to hang by the neck until dead."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.49,0:02:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 皇帝和他的仆人 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The king and his men ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.19,0:02:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 虏走皇后 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Stole the queen from her bed ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.56,0:02:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 将她封印在肉体中 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And bound her in her bones ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.57,0:02:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 大海为我们所拥有 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ T he seas be ours ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.18,0:02:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 拥有无限力量 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And by the powers ∮ ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.75,0:03:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 随心所欲 四处漂流 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Where we will, we'll roam ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 呦吼 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Yo ho ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.47,0:03:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 千万双手 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ All hands ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.20,0:03:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 把帆高挂 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Hoist the colors high ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.61,0:03:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 拒绝 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Heave-ho ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 小偷乞丐 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Thieves and beggars ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.45,0:03:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们永垂不朽 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Never shall we die ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 呦吼 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Yo ho ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.70,0:03:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 齐心协力 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Haul together ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.50,0:03:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 把帆高挂 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Hoist the colors high ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.70,0:03:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝克特勋爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Beckett!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.50,0:03:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们开唱了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've started to sing, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.68,0:04:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 - ∮ 小偷乞丐 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Finally. - ∮ Thieves and beggars ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.48,0:04:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们永垂不朽 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Never shall we die ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:33.32,Title,0,0,0,0,,《加勒比海盗3：世界的尽头》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有人死去 有人活着 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Some have died and some are alive ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.89,0:04:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有人在海上航行 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Others sail on the sea ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.89,0:04:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 带上牢笼的钥匙 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ With the keys to the cage ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 以及严重的后果 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And the devil to pay ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.90,0:04:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们努力前往费德勒绿地（水手们想象中的天堂） ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We lay to Fiddler's Green ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.97,0:05:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 水之坟墓中升起一口钟 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The bell has been raised from its watery grave ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.34,0:05:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 发出阴沉的声音 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Hear its sepulchral tone ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.07,0:05:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 警告所有人 注意暴风雪 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A call to all Pay heed the squall ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.52,0:05:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 转动船帆回家 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Turn your sails to home ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.09,0:05:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 呦吼 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Yo ho ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.83,0:05:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 齐心协力 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Haul together ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.17,0:05:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 把帆高挂 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Hoist the colors high ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.97,0:05:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 拒绝 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Heave-ho ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.67,0:05:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小偷乞丐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thief and beggar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.91,0:05:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们永垂不朽 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Never shall we die ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.45,0:05:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,唱这歌可是要杀头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dangerous song to be singing…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.82,0:05:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使不懂背后的含义\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for any who are ignorant of its meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.15,0:06:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是个女孩子家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Particularly a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.62,0:06:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是孤身一人的女孩子家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Particularly a woman alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你凭什么认为她孤身一人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think she's alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.57,0:06:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你罩着她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You protect her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你凭什么认为我需要别人罩着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what makes you think I need protecting?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.84,0:06:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家老大正等着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your master's expecting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.21,0:06:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,死人会耽误时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And an unexpected death'd cast a slight pall on our meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.01,0:06:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,步伐整齐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick those feet up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.38,0:06:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑步前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the double!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.52,0:06:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝前看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes front!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.20,0:06:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. None.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.96,0:07:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要花上一个星期后 我才不会晕船\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt always takes me about a week to get my sea legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一次 我呕吐得很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was throwing up horribly the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.24,0:07:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,像她那样稳着些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady as she goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.68,0:07:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有威尔的消息吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you heard anything from Will?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,特纳一定会取得航海图的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust young Turner to acquire the charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.76,0:07:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在邵峰船长面前不要没大没小\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you to remember your place in the presence of Captain Sao Feng.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.73,0:07:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真有那么可怕吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he that terrifying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他性情很像我 但心狠手辣 且唯利是图\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's much like myself, but absent my merciful nature and sense of fair play.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.81,0:08:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备通过 准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're through. Make ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.92,0:08:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.53,0:08:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是认为 她是个女人 就不会怀疑到她了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think because she is a woman we would not suspect her of treachery?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你这么说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when you put it that way…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.44,0:08:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.09,0:09:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.37,0:10:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴布萨船长 欢迎来到新加坡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Barbossa, welcome to Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.21,0:10:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,加蒸汽\N{\fnArial\fs30}More steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没门儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.97,0:10:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们不成功 那我们就是唯一的希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If things don't go the way we want, then we're the only chance they've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.21,0:10:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你有事相求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand that you have a request to make of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.88,0:11:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该说是项提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}More of a proposal to put to ye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.35,0:11:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有趟探险 需要一条船 一队人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've a venture underway and I find myself in need of a ship and a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.79,0:11:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是巧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. It's an odd coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.66,0:11:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是有一条闲船 一队闲人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you happen to have a ship and a crew you don't need?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.83,0:11:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为今天早前 附近不远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because earlier this day, not far from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.01,0:11:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个毛贼潜入我叔叔的庙里\N{\fnArial\fs30}a thief broke into my most revered uncle's temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.11,0:11:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,企图偷走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tried to make off with these.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.78,0:11:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,航海图\N{\fnArial\fs30}The navigational charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.12,0:11:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有去世界尽头的路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}The route to the Farthest Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入另一个世界探险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldrt it be amazing if this venture of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.90,0:11:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,会不会很精彩呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}took you to the world beyond this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.37,0:11:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这纯属巧合 不要胡乱猜测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt would strain credulity at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个毛贼 面熟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the thief. Is his face familiar to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.79,0:12:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,留他还有何用？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I guess he has no further need for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到了我的地盘 却辜负了我的盛情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come into my city and you betray my hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.24,0:12:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我向你保证 我不知情 - 你是不知道他会失手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I assure you I had no idea… - That he would get caught!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们企图前往戴维·琼斯的魔狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You intend to attempt the voyage to Davy Jones' Locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.39,0:12:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在想不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I cannot help but wonder…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.39,0:12:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:13:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,起义歌已经被传唱 刻不容缓啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The song has been sung. The time is upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须召集天下海盗王大会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must convene the Brethren Court.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.28,0:13:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,做为九大海盗王之一的你 有责任遵守誓约出席大会\N{\fnArial\fs30}As one of the nine pirate lords, you must honor the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,加蒸汽\N{\fnArial\fs30}More steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.26,0:13:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,加蒸汽\N{\fnArial\fs30}More steam!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.90,0:13:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们人人头上都有悬赏 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There is a price on all our heads. - Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.47,0:13:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这年头海盗也只能靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems the only way a pirate can turn a profit anymore…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.35,0:13:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,出卖其他海盗牟利\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is by betraying other pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.02,0:13:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在应该求同存异\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must put our differences aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.45,0:13:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,等信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.59,0:13:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗王大会制定了海洋公约\N{\fnArial\fs30}The First Brethren Court gave us rule of the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.82,0:13:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝克特勋爵却让这公约失去了效用\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now that rule is being challenged by Lord Cutler Beckett.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.63,0:13:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对东印度公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against East India Trading Company,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.43,0:14:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗公会哪有招架之力？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what value is the Brethren Court?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.77,0:14:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我又能做些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can any of us do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.67,0:14:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以打仗 放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can fight! Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.57,0:14:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是邵峰啊 新加坡大名鼎鼎的海盗王\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Sao Feng, the pirate lord of Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.11,0:14:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你领导了一个时代 勇敢的船长可以自由遨游\N{\fnArial\fs30}You command in an age of piracy where bold captains sail free waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.32,0:14:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,见过的大浪非尺能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where waves aren't measured in feet, but as increments of fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.82,0:14:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过检验的人都成了传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}and those who pass the test become legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.72,0:14:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能眼睁睁地看着这一切 都毁在你的手中么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you have that era come to an end on your watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.06,0:14:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,遍天下的海盗王\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most notorious pirates from around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.79,0:14:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在团结备战\N{\fnArial\fs30}are uniting against our enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟然还躲在洗澡水里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yet you sit here cowering in your bathwater!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.40,0:14:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白·斯旺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth Swann.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要妄下评论\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is more to you than meets the eye, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.31,0:14:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不够格\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the eye does not go wanting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.82,0:14:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我注意到 你们还没回答我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I cannot help but notice you have failed to answer my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.52,0:15:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,找戴维·琼斯的魔狱目的何在？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you seek in Davy Jones' Locker?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.99,0:15:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了杰克·斯派洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.23,0:15:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是海盗王之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one of the pirate lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.17,0:15:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让斯派洛重返人世\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only reason…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.68,0:15:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的理由…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I would want Jack Sparrow returned from the land of the dead…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.41,0:15:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是好亲手把他再送回魔狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is so I can send him back myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.22,0:15:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,九枚西班牙古银币 杰克·斯派洛手上有一枚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack Sparrow holds one of the nine pieces of eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,死前没来得及传给继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He failed to pass it along to a successor before he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.06,0:15:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须把他救回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we must go and get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.90,0:15:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也就是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you admit…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.57,0:15:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在承认欺骗了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you have deceived me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.91,0:15:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,操家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.51,0:15:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,操家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.38,0:16:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,邵峰 我发誓我们的初衷是好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sao Feng, I assure you, our intentions are strictly honorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.49,0:16:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器 不然就杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapons or I kill the man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.83,0:16:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀吧 反正不是我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him. He's not our man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.70,0:16:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是你的人 那就不是我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's not with you, and he's not with us…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.27,0:16:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁的人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who's he with?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.24,0:16:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,装弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意你的后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out! Look behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.39,0:17:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.22,0:17:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.03,0:17:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,航海图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chart!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.07,0:17:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,整队 准备 开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Company! Make ready. Set. Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.68,0:18:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,整队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Company!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.74,0:18:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备 开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make ready. Set.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是巧 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt's an odd coincidence, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.30,0:18:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚到新加坡 东印度公司就找到我的头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The East India Trading Company finds me the day you show up in Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.31,0:18:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯属巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is coincidence only.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.48,0:18:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想和贝克特交易 就需要我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lf you want to make a deal with Beckett, you need what I offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.59,0:18:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经背叛了巴布萨 现在还要背叛斯派洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cross Barbossa. You are willing to cross Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.52,0:18:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我凭什么信任你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I expect any better?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.26,0:18:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要黑珍珠号救回我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the Black Pearl to free my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.40,0:19:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以帮我夺得黑珍珠号\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're helping me to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.95,0:19:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.60,0:19:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.21,0:19:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 得到航海图了吗？- 不仅如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have the charts? - And better yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.65,0:19:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一条船 一队人 - 邵峰哪去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A ship and a crew. - Where's Sao Feng?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会保护我们脱身 然后在沉船湾和我们会面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll cover our escape and meet us at Shipwreck Cove.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.38,0:19:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way. Be quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.56,0:20:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽力绑紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haul the snotters with a will!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.33,0:20:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,绑紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it taut.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意安全 装载货物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secure provisions and stow the cargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.17,0:20:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,邵峰现已无藏身之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no place left for Sao Feng to cower.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.60,0:20:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会遵守誓约吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think he will honor the call?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.54,0:20:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,海上的凶神恶煞\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an evil on these seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.71,0:20:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算嗜血海盗也会畏惧三分\N{\fnArial\fs30}that even the most staunch and bloodthirsty pirates have come to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.15,0:21:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,西班牙古银币\N{\fnArial\fs30}A piece of eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.35,0:21:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说 有9件的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine of them, you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.16,0:21:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们新加坡的新朋友很特别 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our new friend in Singapore was very specific, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.33,0:21:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,九枚西班牙古银币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine pieces of eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.99,0:21:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,背后有什么含义呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the significance of that, I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.63,0:21:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的舰队所向披靡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing can hold against the armada.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.03,0:21:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是「飞翔的荷兰人号」也不是对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with the Flying Dutchman at the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.33,0:21:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing we know of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.24,0:21:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那个朋友提到海盗公会 将在哪里开会吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did your friend mention where the Brethren Court are meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:21:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他支支吾吾的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was mum on that, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.44,0:21:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.98,0:22:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他懂得消息的价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he knows the value of information.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.48,0:22:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些话不要对外人透漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better keep this between ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.35,0:22:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,免得某些人趁机逃到新加坡去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want anyone running off to Singapore, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.52,0:22:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 司令官 - 您找我 贝克特勋爵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah, admiral. - You summoned me, Lord Beckett.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.33,0:22:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 有件东西给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Something for you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.13,0:22:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,新官上任 找位老战友协助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your new station deserves an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.28,0:22:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有征用令了吧？- 没了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not more requisition orders. - No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.68,0:22:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下死刑令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.12,0:22:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗公会知道他们面临灭顶之灾\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Brethren know they face extinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.33,0:22:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们唯一可选的是去哪里做殊死一搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that remains is for them to decide where they make their final stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.49,0:23:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人说过会这么冷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one said anything about cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,苦尽则甘来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure there must be a good reason for our suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.53,0:23:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个臭女人怎么不把杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't that obeah woman bring Jack back the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.53,0:23:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 像巴布萨那样也带回来？- 因为巴布萨只是死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- she brought back Barbossa? - Because Barbossa was only dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.37,0:23:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而杰克·斯派洛的躯体和魂魄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack Sparrow is taken, body and soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.71,0:23:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非被囚禁在死亡地带 而是在惩罚地带\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a place not of death, but punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.95,0:23:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人最悲惨的命运莫过于此\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst fate a person can bring upon himself…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.22,0:23:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能无奈的面对永久\N{\fnArial\fs30}…stretching on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.89,0:23:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是戴维·琼斯的魔狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what awaits at Davy Jones' Locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.56,0:24:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我就知道有原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I knew there was a good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.91,0:24:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有标识吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing here is set.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.38,0:24:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可没有现代航海图精确\N{\fnArial\fs30}These can't be as accurate as modern charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.62,0:24:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但它可以带我们去很多地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But it leads to more places.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.36,0:24:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,「越过边缘」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Over the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.96,0:24:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,「再来一次」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over again."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.23,0:24:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,日出时会释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sunrise sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.00,0:24:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,「绿灿烂」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flash of green."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.87,0:24:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,来给大家解释一下吧 巴布萨船长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you care to interpret, Captain Barbossa?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.68,0:24:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,目睹过「绿灿烂」吗？吉布斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever gazed upon the green flash, Master Gibbs?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.62,0:24:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有幸目睹过 极为罕见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I reckon I seen my fair share. Happens on rare occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.26,0:25:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,日落前的一霎那 绿灿烂直冲云霄\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last glimpse of sunset, a green flash shoots up into the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.46,0:25:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人终其一生也无法看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some go their whole lives without ever seeing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.53,0:25:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人谎称见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some claim to have seen it who ain't. And some say…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.43,0:25:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着一个灵魂重返人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It signals when a soul comes back to this world from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.17,0:25:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 相信我 小特纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - Trust me, young Master Turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.84,0:25:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死亡之地并不难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not getting to the land of the dead that's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.42,0:25:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何返回才是问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.83,0:26:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,水手 逆风 扬帆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bosun! Head to wind! Lift the sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.50,0:26:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, aye, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.90,0:26:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈的 片甲不留\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody hell. There's nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.07,0:26:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯太放肆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jones is a loose cannon, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.91,0:26:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,去取亡灵箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fetch the chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.58,0:26:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the governor?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.51,0:26:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对那颗「心」颇感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been asking questions about the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.85,0:26:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道其中秘密吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.26,0:26:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他就不再有利用价值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then perhaps his usefulness has run its course.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.15,0:27:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step lively, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.62,0:27:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step lively!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.26,0:27:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,往前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.17,0:27:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,站稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.64,0:28:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,统统给我滚 把这可怕的东西也给我带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. All of you. And take that infernal thing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.58,0:28:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不允许它上我的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not have it on my ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.62,0:28:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在抱歉 是我允许的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry to hear that… because I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.22,0:28:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这样才能让这条船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it seems to be the only way to ensure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.19,0:28:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵从东印度公司的指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}that this ship do as directed by the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.80,0:28:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要拷问犯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need prisoners to interrogate,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.30,0:28:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,犯人活着才能拷问\N{\fnArial\fs30}which tends to work best when they're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.57,0:28:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷兰人只听从其船长的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dutchman sails as its captain commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.54,0:28:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,其船长也必须听从命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}And its captain is to sail it as commanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.05,0:28:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我下令让你杀了你的「宠物」时 你就应该明白这个道理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have thought you'd learned that when I ordered you to kill your pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.12,0:28:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已经不是你的天下了 琼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no longer your world, Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.66,0:28:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,废物…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The immaterial has become…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.16,0:28:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,终究是个废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}…immaterial.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.00,0:29:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备 瞄准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charge your bayonets.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.07,0:29:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还要这样冷战多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do we continue not talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.48,0:29:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,救出杰克后 就没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we rescue Jack, everything'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.12,0:29:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去救杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we rescue Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.85,0:30:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要得到最想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what we want most…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.05,0:30:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要为此付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there is a cost must be paid in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.63,0:30:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴布萨 看前方 - 没错 我们迷失方向了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Barbossa, ahead! - Aye, we're good and lost now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.47,0:30:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迷失方向了？- 只有迷失方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lost? - For certain you have to be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.17,0:30:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能到达一个无人能找到的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find a place as can't be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.24,0:30:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然大家都知道在哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elseways, everyone would know where it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.88,0:30:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 速度在加快 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're gaining speed. - Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.35,0:30:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,各就各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}To stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.05,0:31:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家各就各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}All hands to stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.36,0:31:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,满舵 左舷 全速前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rudder full. Hard aport! Gather way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.33,0:31:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要动 让它朝前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nay! Belay that! Let her run straight and true!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.07,0:31:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blimey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.31,0:31:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你把我们都害死了 - 不要说得这么难听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've doomed us all. - Don't be so unkind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.75,0:31:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次再走这条路可能就过不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may not survive to pass this way again,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.49,0:31:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我最后的忠告\N{\fnArial\fs30}and these be the last friendly words you'll hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.10,0:31:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它绑牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tie her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.00,0:31:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,左满舵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard aport.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.45,0:32:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓稳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.41,0:32:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,投降吧 你们这群蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike your colors, you blooming cockroaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.12,0:32:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,死人不会告密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead men tell no tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.84,0:33:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的花生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My peanut.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.87,0:33:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉紧绳索 松开转帆索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haul the halyard. Slacken braces.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.01,0:33:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 船长 松开转帆索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, captain. Slacken braces.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.38,0:33:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step lively with a will.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.58,0:33:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 是的 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aye, aye. - Right away, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.25,0:33:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望下面着火了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a fire down below!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.05,0:33:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救我！- 打起精神来 你们这帮懒虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help. - Man the yards, you filthy toads.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.77,0:34:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉呀 拉呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haul! Haul!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.64,0:34:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把帆准备好 准备前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haul the sheets handsomely. Scandalize the lateens.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.58,0:34:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 遵命 - 遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aye, sir. - Right away, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.39,0:34:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯派洛先生 - 是 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Sparrow? - Aye, cap'n.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.13,0:34:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为你绑得怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What say you about the condition of this tack line?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.56,0:34:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绑得蛮好啊 船长 - 绑好了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It be proper to my eyes, sir. - Proper?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.07,0:34:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有绑好 也不合适 无法接受 力度不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt is neither proper nor suitable, sir. It is not acceptable nor adequate.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.01,0:34:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么明显 还敢还嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is, in obvious fact, an abomination.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.51,0:34:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 船长 再给一个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begging your pardon, sir, but if you gave a man another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.45,0:34:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.35,0:34:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你这种观念 才让我们沦落到今天这般地步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt's that sort of thinking got us into this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.16,0:35:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,船速慢了 时间浪费了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have lost speed and, therefore, time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.09,0:35:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贵的时间啊 浪费了就追不回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precious time, which cannot be recovered once lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.40,0:35:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都听明白了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.27,0:35:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 船长 - 都明白了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aye, aye, captain. - Do you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.94,0:35:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在都得重来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt will all have to be redone. All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.21,0:35:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是散漫的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let this serve as a lesson to the lot of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.74,0:35:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 大家都在拼命地干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doldrums, sir, has the entire crew on edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.31,0:35:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于你们这帮蛆虫 我一点都不同情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no sympathy for any of you feculent maggots,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.35,0:35:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不想再容忍你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no more patience to pretend otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.05,0:35:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,船员们 我不干这稀奇古怪的勾当了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, I wash my hands of this weirdness.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.60,0:35:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没风\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.50,0:35:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不应该有风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, there's no bloody wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.11,0:35:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我的灵魂发誓 来一阵微风\N{\fnArial\fs30}My soul I do swear for a breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.64,0:35:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,飒飒的响 轻轻的拂面而过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gust. Whisper. A tiny, miniature lick.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.26,0:36:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我知道 但为什么啊 到底为什么啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir, I know, but why? Why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.83,0:36:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他傻呗 是不是啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he's a lummox, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.60,0:36:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要开个隆重的庭院派对 就不请你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall have a magnificent garden party and you're not invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.55,0:36:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.00,0:36:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.56,0:37:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被石头跟踪 这还是头一遭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're being followed by rocks. Never had that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.44,0:37:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.90,0:37:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,绳索\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.97,0:39:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不毛之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}This truly is a godforsaken place.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.84,0:39:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看到杰克啊 一个人也看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see Jack. I don't see anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.24,0:39:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.95,0:40:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴维·琼斯从不会让任何人从这里逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Davy Jones never once gave up that what he took.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.32,0:40:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在说这个又有什么用？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.82,0:40:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你害的 我们被困在这里 处境和杰克一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trapped here by your doing. No different than Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.06,0:40:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克远在天边近在眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witty Jack is closer than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.84,0:40:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.04,0:41:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.42,0:41:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好象做梦一样 真的是杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slap me thrice and hand me to me mama. It's Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.46,0:41:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是船长 - 正是我们船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's the captain! - A sight for sore eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.23,0:41:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,把浪姆酒藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide the rum.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.40,0:41:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吉布斯？- 是我 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Gibbs. - Aye, cap'n.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.40,0:41:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.84,0:41:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要对你的行为负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expect you're able to account for your actions, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.87,0:41:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.94,0:41:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么久以来 为什么我船上纪律这么涣散\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been a perpetual and virulent lack of discipline upon my vessel. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.05,0:41:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么会这样？- 船长 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why is that, sir? - Sir, you're…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.22,0:41:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 你在戴维·琼斯的魔狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in Davy Jones' Locker, cap'n.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.72,0:41:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然知道 我知道我身处何地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that. I know where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.09,0:41:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要以为我不知道 - 杰克·斯派洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And don't think I don't. - Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.03,0:41:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 赫克托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Hector.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.97,0:42:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been too long. Hasrt it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.97,0:42:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得当初 你一枪把我打死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye. Isla de Muerta, remember? You shot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.17,0:42:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才没有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.11,0:42:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,提亚·朵玛 出来散步吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tia Dalma, out and about, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.28,0:42:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是给精神病人带来点死亡的快感\N{\fnArial\fs30}You add an agreeable sense of the macabre to any delirium.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.52,0:42:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以为我们是他的幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks we're a hallucination.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.32,0:42:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}William, tell me something:
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.06,0:42:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来求我救一位让人忧伤的少女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you come because you need my help to save a certain distressing damsel,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.16,0:42:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是一位本就忧伤的少女？\N{\fnArial\fs30}or rather, damsel in distress? Either one.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.26,0:42:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.33,0:42:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就不会来 也就不该在这里出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, you wouldn't be here, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.83,0:42:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能来这 所以你根本不在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can't be here. Q.E.D., you're not really here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.90,0:42:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.44,0:42:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的 我们真的来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is real. We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.35,0:42:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说这里是魔狱？- 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Locker, you say? - Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.46,0:42:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've come to rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.36,0:43:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 感谢你们的好意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you, now? That's very kind of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.96,0:43:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我有船 你们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it would seem that as I possess a ship and you don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.43,0:43:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们才需要被救呢 我现在没心情救你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're the ones in need of rescuing, and I'm not sure as I'm in the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.37,0:43:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的船 就在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see my ship. Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.41,0:43:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看不到啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't spot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.02,0:43:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是条小船 躲在黑珍珠号后面什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be a tiny little thing hiding somewhere behind the Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.42,0:43:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 贝克特勋爵已经得到了戴维·琼斯的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, Cutler Beckett has the heart of Davy Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.29,0:43:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他控制了飞翔的荷兰人号 - 统治了整个海洋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He controls the Flying Dutchman. - He's taking over the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.72,0:43:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,起义歌已经被唱了 海盗公会被召集了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The song has been sung. The Brethren Court is called.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.66,0:43:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才走开几天 就被你们搞得天翻地覆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave you alone for a minute, look what happens. Everything's gone to pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.53,0:43:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 大家需要你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye. The world needs you back something fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.27,0:43:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也需要一队船员\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you need a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.17,0:43:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要和你们同船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I sail with any of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.44,0:43:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们当中四个人曾想杀我 其中一个得手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four of you have tried to kill me in the past. One of you succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.68,0:43:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没告诉你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she's not told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.18,0:44:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们就待在这里好好谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have loads to talk about while you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.39,0:44:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.09,0:44:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…不要跟我说你当时不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now… don't tell me you didn't enjoy it at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.93,0:44:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得有理 女士 算你一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair enough. All right, you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.07,0:44:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要你 你吓着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't need you. You scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.07,0:44:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,考顿 你可以过来 马蒂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gibbs, you can come. Marty. Mm…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.01,0:44:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,考顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cotton.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.74,0:44:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,鹦鹉考顿 我有点犹豫 不过起码能聊天解闷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cottors parrot, I'm a little iffy, but at least I'll have someone to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.45,0:44:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.82,0:44:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰洪 这些都是我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tai Huang. These are my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.78,0:44:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你效忠谁？- 谁出价高 就效忠谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where do your allegiances lie? - With the highest bidder.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.06,0:44:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有条船 - 它使得你出价最高\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have a ship. - That makes you the highest bidder.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.79,0:44:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好人啊 提锚扬帆 准备起航\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good man. Weigh anchor, all hands. Prepare to make sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.90,0:44:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,起锚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weigh anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.67,0:44:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.60,0:44:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你往哪去啊？杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way are you going, Jack?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.34,0:44:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,调整船帆 松开转帆索和帆脚索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trim that sail. Slack windward brace and sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.71,0:45:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉起浮标垂索 - 拉起浮标垂索\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Haul the pennant line. - Haul the pennant line.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.35,0:45:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.85,0:45:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛？- 不 我问你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - No, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.52,0:45:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛？- 不 我问你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - No, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.36,0:45:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？船长在船上是下令的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you? Captain gives orders on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.93,0:45:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长已经在下令了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The captain of the ship is giving orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.66,0:45:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的船 我是船长 - 可航海图是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My ship, makes me captain. - They be my charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.73,0:45:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你也只是海图员\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes you "chartman."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.30,0:45:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！你们俩个！这是命令 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stow it! The both of you! That's an order! Understand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.04,0:45:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 既然船长位子悬而未决的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I just thought with the captain issue in doubt,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.31,0:45:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不妨也考虑我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd throw in my name for consideration.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.32,0:45:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.32,0:45:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会投你的票 - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'd vote for you. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.03,0:46:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把杰克丢给挪威海怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left Jack to the Kraken.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.96,0:46:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经被救了 都过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's rescued now. It's done with.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.27,0:46:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will, I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.47,0:46:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选择了对我隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose not to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.28,0:46:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.35,0:46:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不该由你来承担\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasrt your burden to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.95,0:46:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是我承担了 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did bear it, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.52,0:46:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不知道自己承担了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just didn't know what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.19,0:46:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.99,0:46:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我爱他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought I loved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.50,0:47:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你凡事都独自决定 叫我怎么能信任你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you make your choices alone, how can I trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.34,0:47:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.20,0:47:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可怕啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eerie.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.14,0:47:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,毛骨悚然\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's downright macabre.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.85,0:47:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是往他们身上丢颗炮弹会怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder what would happen if you dropped a cannonball on one of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.43,0:48:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,太没礼貌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be disrespectful, it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.70,0:48:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们本该由戴维·琼斯照顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should be in the care of Davy Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.10,0:48:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the duty him was charged with…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.57,0:48:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是女神科莉布索指定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by the goddess, Calypso.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.14,0:48:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,将死于海中的灵魂送到彼岸去\N{\fnArial\fs30}To ferry those who die at sea to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.25,0:48:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,每隔十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every ten years…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.02,0:48:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以上岸一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}…him could come ashore…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.19,0:48:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,和真正爱他的女人欢聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to be with she who love him… truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.83,0:48:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那个人已经变成了怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the man has become a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.04,0:48:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说 他并非一直 是那章鱼怪的模样吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he wasrt always… tentacley?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.18,0:48:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.55,0:48:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾经是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him was a man…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.01,0:48:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…once.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.32,0:49:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有船来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there's boats coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.03,0:49:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对我们没有威胁 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not a threat to us. Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.40,0:49:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对他们来说不过是鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are nothing but ghosts to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.07,0:49:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们任意漂流吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's best just let them be.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.82,0:49:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我父亲 我们回到阳间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my father. We've made it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.36,0:49:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲 我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father! Father, here, look here!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.73,0:49:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.77,0:49:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没到阳间呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.41,0:49:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.71,0:50:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白 你死了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth. Are you dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.45,0:50:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.79,0:50:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该是死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.55,0:50:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不能死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.69,0:50:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是亡灵箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this chest, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.33,0:50:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一只 当时它很重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's odd. At the time it seemed so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.67,0:50:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,上船来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.97,0:50:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那颗心\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.80,0:50:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你插死了那颗心 你的心脏就得来顶替\N{\fnArial\fs30}I learned that if you stab the heart, yours must take its place.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.14,0:50:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会永远在海上航行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will sail the seas for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.74,0:50:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,「荷兰人」号一定要有位船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dutchman must have a captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.82,0:50:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为这个死 真不值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silly thing to die for.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.18,0:50:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁扔条绳子下去 快上来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone, cast a line. Come back with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.26,0:50:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.42,0:50:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,命中注定\N{\fnArial\fs30}A touch… of destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.53,0:50:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.34,0:50:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真为你自豪 伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so proud of you, Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.60,0:50:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 抓住绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, the line! Take the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.14,0:51:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她绝不能离开这船 - 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She must not leave the ship! - Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.55,0:51:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你和我们走 求你了 我不能离开你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please come with us! Please! No! I won't leave you!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.45,0:51:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给你母亲带个好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give your love to your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.52,0:51:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你了 我不能放手让你走 - 伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, I won't let you go! - Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.46,0:51:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.63,0:51:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么办法吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a way?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.70,0:51:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他心甘情愿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.81,0:51:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No water.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.52,0:51:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么只剩朗姆酒了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is all but the rum gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.25,0:51:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,朗姆酒也喝没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rum's gone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.86,0:51:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们入夜前还逃不出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we cannot escape these doldrums before night,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.57,0:52:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我们就要被困在 漫无边际的大海上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear we will sail on trackless seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.54,0:52:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远在世界之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doomed to roam the reach between worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.57,0:52:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.74,0:52:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没水喝才是燃眉之急\N{\fnArial\fs30}With no water, forever looks to be arriving a mite too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.28,0:52:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么无能为力呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why doesn't he do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.42,0:52:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的眼珠 还给我 - 实在搞不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me eye. Give it back! - There's no sense to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.35,0:52:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,日落时才会有绿灿烂 而不是日出时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the green flash happens at sunset, not sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.06,0:52:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,「超越边缘」… 我真的要疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Over the edge." Ah, it's driving me over the blooming edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.36,0:52:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,日出时怎么会「落」呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunrises don't set.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.83,0:52:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,上就是下\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Up is down."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.80,0:52:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么狗屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's just maddeningly unelpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.37,0:52:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么总要拐弯抹角？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are these things never clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.41,0:52:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 已经明说了 杰克 - 什么？嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clear as mud, Jackie. - What? Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.91,0:52:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 捅那颗心 - 别捅那颗心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stab the heart. - Don't stab the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.48,0:52:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么说？- 「荷兰人」号一定要有船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come again? - The Dutchman must have a captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.72,0:52:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是在帮倒忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's even more than less than unelpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.32,0:52:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远在海上航行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sail the seas for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.16,0:53:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢海洋 - 不能上岸怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love the sea. - What about port?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.16,0:53:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更喜欢朗姆酒 朗姆酒是好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer rum. Rum's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.23,0:53:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,上岸 就有朗姆酒和女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making port. Where we can get rum, and salty wenches…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.64,0:53:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 十年一次 - 他说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Once every 10 years. - What'd he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.31,0:53:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 十年一次 - 十年可是很久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Once every 10 years. - Ten years is a long time, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.84,0:53:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是没朗姆酒就会更久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even longer given the deficit of rum.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.25,0:53:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但永远还是更长啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But eternity is longer still.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.25,0:53:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你打算如何消受永久呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how will you be spending it? Dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.95,0:53:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,死着呢？还是活着呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.42,0:53:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不死的斯派洛船长 - 哦 我喜欢这头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The immortal Captain Sparrow. - Oh, I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.59,0:53:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰到日落时也无所谓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come sunset, it won't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.73,0:53:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是日落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.70,0:53:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,日落是下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sundown.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.87,0:53:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,日出 就是上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And rise. Up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.67,0:53:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.68,0:53:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？不知道 你说呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that? I don't know. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.88,0:53:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪里？- 在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - There.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.37,0:54:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.75,0:54:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在摇晃船\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's rocking the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.92,0:54:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在摇晃船\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're rocking the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.66,0:54:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈 给他破解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye. He's onto it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.83,0:54:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在让船摇晃\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's rocking the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.63,0:54:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把自己倒着绑在主桅上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll tie each other to the mast upside down,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.10,0:54:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等船翻过来 我们就朝上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so when the boat flips we'll be the right way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.87,0:54:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,加把力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time it with the swell.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.04,0:54:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一群懒猪 快把系炮绳松开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loose the cannons, you lazy bilge rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.48,0:55:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,把货物解开 让它们滚起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unstow the cargo. Let it shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.08,0:56:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now up…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.02,0:56:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.35,0:57:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你的馊主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was your idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.92,0:57:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blessed sweet westerlies!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.56,0:57:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.36,0:58:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是日出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt's the sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.81,0:58:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parley?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.88,0:58:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得拿枪 赶快把我们解开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need our pistols! Get untied, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.80,0:58:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.26,0:58:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗公会会在沉船湾聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Brethren Court is a-gathering at Shipwreck Cove.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.47,0:58:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 你和我得出席 这无可争议吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Jack, you and I are a-going. There'll be no arguing that point.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.24,0:58:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有争议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I is arguing the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.71,0:58:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群海盗成帮结伙 我可要离你们远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's pirates a-gathering, I'm pointing my ship the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.41,0:58:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗集起来是要对付贝克特 你也是海盗的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pirates are gathering to fight Beckett, and you're a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.91,0:58:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你愿不愿打 你跑不了 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight or not, you're not running, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.28,0:58:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不团结 他们就会把我们一个一个干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't stand together, they'll hunt us down one by one,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.39,0:59:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,到最后只剩下你一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}till there be none left but you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.92,0:59:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不错啊 杰克·斯派洛船长 最后的海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite like the sound of that. Captain Jack Sparrow, the last pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.46,0:59:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.00,0:59:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就得独自对付琼斯了 你对此有计划吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll be fighting Jones alone. How does that figure into your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.43,0:59:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still working on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.50,0:59:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我绝对不回那魔狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will not be going back to the Locker, mate. Count on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.68,0:59:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,火药湿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wet powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.75,0:59:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 湿归湿 还是可以当棒子用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! We can still use them as clubs!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.29,0:59:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 对不起 挺好用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ow! - Sorry. Effective, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.93,0:59:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这岛上有淡水\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's fresh water on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.03,0:59:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以先补给 然后再拼个你死我活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can resupply there and get back to shooting each other later.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.96,0:59:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们上岸去快活吧 我要待在我的船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lead the shore party. I'll stay with my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.23,0:59:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你掌管我的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll not be leaving my ship in your command.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.74,0:59:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们干嘛不一起上岸 让我来掌管这船呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you both go ashore and leave the ship in my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.61,0:59:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temporarily.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.76,1:00:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心船啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.37,1:00:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的天啊 - 好大的尸体啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Criminy. - Odds bodkins!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.30,1:00:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful! Careful!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.83,1:00:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这条蠢鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stupid fish!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.87,1:00:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上是头足类动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually it's a cephalopod.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.30,1:00:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你对了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serves you right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.64,1:01:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有人会花钱来看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pin, I bet people would pay a shilling to see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.71,1:01:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会有人出钱来给他们画像\N{\fnArial\fs30}And another shilling for a sketch of them sitting atop!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.94,1:01:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,平特尔和瑞盖提 章鱼怪杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pintel and Ragetti, Kraken slayers.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.05,1:01:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以一块一块割了卖钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could serve up a slice as a souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.95,1:01:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在想着逃跑吗？杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still thinking of running, Jack?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.32,1:01:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能跑出这个世界吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you can outrun the world?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.50,1:01:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久 其他人逐渐死光\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the problem with being the last of anything…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.40,1:01:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是孤家寡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by and by, there be none left at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.50,1:01:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候事情会重复 你和我就是见证啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes things come back, mate. We're living proof, you and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.58,1:01:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是在赌博 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, but that's a gamble of long odds, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.41,1:01:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,能否回来 可不是定数\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's never a guarantee of coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.58,1:01:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,早晚要死倒是肯定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But passing on, that's dead certain.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.62,1:01:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,要召集海盗公会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Summoning the Brethren Court, then, is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.69,1:01:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们唯一的希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt's our only hope, lad.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.83,1:01:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话太让人心寒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a sad commentary in and of itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.47,1:02:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界曾经很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world used to be a bigger place.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.80,1:02:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界还是一样大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world's still the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.64,1:02:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我们的空间小了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just… less in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.70,1:02:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,水中有毒 被尸体污染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poisoned. Fouled by the body.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.84,1:02:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在新加坡见过这人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, I know him. He was in Singapore!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.71,1:02:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 新加坡 - 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Singapore. - Captain!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.55,1:02:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗬！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hoy!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.72,1:02:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got company!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.00,1:03:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才是船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.14,1:03:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,邵峰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sao Feng…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.51,1:03:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出现在这真是太巧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you showing up here, it is truly a remarkable coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.82,1:03:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·斯派洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.42,1:03:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经羞辱过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You paid me great insult once.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.59,1:03:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这听起来不像是我的为人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't sound like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.00,1:03:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这就算扯平了如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we just call it square, then?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.70,1:03:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release her.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.67,1:03:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她不在交易之中 - 什么交易？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's not part of the bargain. - And what bargain be that?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.37,1:03:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听见特纳船长的话了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard Captain Turner.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.91,1:03:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开她 - 特纳船长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Release her! - "Captain Turner"?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.58,1:03:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这臭小子背信弃义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, the perfidious rotter led a mutiny against us!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.41,1:03:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要黑珍珠号来救回我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the Pearl to free my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.05,1:03:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我参与的唯一原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only reason I came on this voyage.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.09,1:04:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你不告诉你的计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me you were planning this?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.99,1:04:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我肩负的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt was my burden to bear.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.43,1:04:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要黑珍珠号 特纳船长需要黑珍珠号\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs the Pearl. Captain Turner needs the Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.80,1:04:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在感到内疚了 你和你的海盗公会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you felt guilty. And you and your Brethren Court.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.90,1:04:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没人只是因为想我才来救我的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did no one come to save me just because they missed me?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.05,1:04:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我站在他们一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm standing with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.69,1:04:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 杰克 有位老朋友想要先见见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Jack, but there is an old friend who wants to see you first.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.42,1:04:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这老朋友会不会要我的命呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not certain I can survive any more visits from old friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.46,1:04:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的机会去找出答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is your chance to find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.11,1:04:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,很奇怪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curious.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.84,1:05:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友看起来很绝望啊 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends appear to be quite desperate, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.08,1:05:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不再相信一群乌合之众\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps they no longer believe that a gathering of squabbling pirates.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.69,1:05:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,能打赢飞翔的荷兰人号\N{\fnArial\fs30}can defeat the Flying Dutchman.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.39,1:05:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝望可以导致背叛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so despair leads to betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.22,1:05:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,背叛对你我来说并不陌生 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you and I are no strangers to betrayal, are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.00,1:05:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在这 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt's not here, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.90,1:05:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？什么不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What isn't?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.37,1:05:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴维·琼斯的心脏 安全的存放在荷兰人号上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heart of Davy Jones. It's safely aboard the Dutchman,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.94,1:05:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没法用它来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so unavailable for use as leverage.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.04,1:05:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,偿还你欠船长的债了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to satisfy your debt to the good captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.78,1:05:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 我的债已经偿还了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By my reckoning, that account has been settled.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.18,1:05:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}By your death?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.32,1:05:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet here you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.92,1:05:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上眼 假装这是一场恶梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close your eyes and pretend it's all a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.62,1:05:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是这么活过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I get by.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.96,1:05:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果戴维·琼斯知道你活着呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if Davy Jones were to learn of your survival?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.20,1:05:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,船桨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ship oars.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.73,1:05:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,船桨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ship oars.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.60,1:05:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意了 船员们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be on your guard, men.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.84,1:06:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人足够驾驭珍珠号\N{\fnArial\fs30}My men are crew enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.77,1:06:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,公司的船当然要用我们自己的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Company ship, company crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.01,1:06:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答应过黑珍珠号归我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You agreed. The Black Pearl was to be mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.81,1:06:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是当过了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.28,1:06:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你会考虑其他方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you'll consider an alternative arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.42,1:06:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不需要付出 只要出一点信息而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}One which requires absolutely nothing from you but information.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.10,1:06:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是海盗公会的事了 作为交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regarding the Brethren Court, no doubt. In exchange for fair compensation?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.87,1:06:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,结清我欠琼斯的债\N{\fnArial\fs30}Square my debt with Jones…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.98,1:06:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证我的自由 可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…guarantee my freedom?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.91,1:06:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.61,1:06:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是桩不错的生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just good business.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.62,1:06:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁我我心情好 你想让我告诉你什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were I in a divulgatory mood, what then might I divulge?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.49,1:06:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.16,1:06:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,会议在哪举行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they meeting?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.26,1:06:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗王都是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are the pirate lords?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.23,1:06:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,九枚西班牙银币的用处是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the purpose of the nine pieces of eight?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.07,1:07:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备一下船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare the brig.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.87,1:07:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝克特同意把黑珍珠号给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beckett agreed the Black Pearl was to be mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.84,1:07:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝克特爵士不会放弃一艘 能赢过荷兰人号的船 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not going to give up the only ship as can outrun the Dutchman, is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.65,1:07:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是不会遵守诺言的 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shame they're not bound to honor the code of the Brethren, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.09,1:07:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这年头已经没有信誉可言了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because honor's a hard thing to come by nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.99,1:07:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没必要和输家为伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no honor to remaining with the losing side.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.26,1:07:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,见风转舵是最明智的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaving it for the winning side, that's just good business.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.87,1:07:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说输家吗？- 他们有荷兰人号\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The losing side, you say? - They have the Dutchman.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.81,1:07:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在珍珠号也归他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the Pearl!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.31,1:07:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗公会还有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do the Brethren have?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.95,1:07:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有科莉布索（海中女神）\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have Calypso.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.79,1:07:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,科莉布索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calypso.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.23,1:08:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,古老传说而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}An old legend.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.36,1:08:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 女神被封印在凡人体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. The goddess herself, bound in human form.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.74,1:08:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,想一想 利用海洋的力量 用来对付我们的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine all the power of the seas brought to bear against our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.07,1:08:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把她释放出来 但为此我需要召集公会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intend to release her. But for that I need the Brethren Court.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.75,1:08:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的海盗王\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the Court.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.22,1:08:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就监禁巴罗萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can keep Barbossa.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.99,1:08:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个残暴的小人 还他那个木头眼睛的小跟屁虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The belligerent homunculus and his friend with the wooden eye, both.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.12,1:08:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有特纳 尤其是特纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Turner. Especially Turner.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.73,1:08:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人跟我上珍珠号 然后带你去沉船湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest go with me on the Pearl. I'll lead you to Shipwreck Cove,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.26,1:08:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把海盗们交给你 但你不能把我交给琼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I will hand you the pirates and you will not hand me to Jones.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.67,1:08:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很公平吧 你觉得呢？- 那斯旺小姐怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bloody fair deal, don't you think? - And what becomes of Miss Swann?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.94,1:08:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对她有何兴趣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What interest is she to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.61,1:08:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么建议？船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you proposing, captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.05,1:09:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算接受什么呢？船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}What be accepting, cap'n?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.52,1:09:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那女孩 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The girl. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.96,1:09:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.19,1:09:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚想起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just recalled.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.06,1:09:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个神奇的罗盘 能指向我想去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got this wonderful compass, which points to whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.60,1:09:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我还要你做什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So for what do I need you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.94,1:09:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白不能用来做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth is not part of any bargain.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.77,1:09:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.17,1:09:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was not a question.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.04,1:09:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,指向你最想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Points to the thing you want most.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.88,1:09:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那不是海盗公会吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is not the Brethren Court, is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.15,1:09:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么呢？杰克 - 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then what is, Jack? - Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.32,1:09:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我死 - 成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dead. - Done.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.55,1:09:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Not done.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.29,1:09:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你让我们陷入困境的 如果能让我们找到出路 就成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got us into this. If it frees us, then done!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.92,1:09:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.23,1:09:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 如果我杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although, if I kill you, then I can use the compass.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.07,1:09:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以自己用罗盘来找到沉船湾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find Shipwreck Cove, is it, on my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.90,1:09:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不需要中间人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut out the middle man, as it were.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.34,1:09:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白 他们是海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth, they are pirates.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.14,1:09:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和海盗打交道也不止一次两次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have had more than enough experience dealing with pirates!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.25,1:10:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们达成共识了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we have an accord?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.48,1:10:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我杀了 你自己找到海湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}With me killed, you'd arrive at the cove,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.12,1:10:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现那是一个攻不破的堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}find it a stronghold, nigh impregnable…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.39,1:10:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,足以顶住数年的封锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}…able to withstand blockade for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.39,1:10:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时就会想 要是当初没杀某人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you'd be wishing, "lf only there was someone I had not killed inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.10,1:10:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能让海盗们自投罗网了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to ensure that the pirates then come outside."
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.40,1:10:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做到这些吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can accomplish all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.60,1:10:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,士可杀不可辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may kill me, but you may never insult me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.01,1:10:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.38,1:10:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是杰克·斯派洛船长啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Captain Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.92,1:10:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.35,1:11:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人落水！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man overboard!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.60,1:11:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.10,1:11:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 不然我还没这个胆儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank goodness. If I wasrt, this'd probably never work.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.02,1:11:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连一滴朗姆酒都没喝哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that was without even a single drop of rum.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.70,1:12:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个胆小的令人厌恶的叛徒关进船舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send this pestilent, traitorous, cowhearted, yeasty codpiece to the brig.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.71,1:12:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该追哪条船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which ship do we follow?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.44,1:12:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,发信号让荷兰人号盯住邵峰 我们跟着珍珠号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signal the Dutchman to track down Sao Feng. We follow the Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.08,1:12:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要多少时间才可以出发？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How soon can we have the ship ready to pursue?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.49,1:12:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's going down!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.85,1:12:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,站直了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.49,1:12:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是事先都计划好了 还是随时起意呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think he plans it all out, or just makes it up as he goes along?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.27,1:12:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.68,1:13:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天此时 我们就能抵达沉船湾 到时你就自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By this time tomorrow, we will arrive at Shipwreck Cove and you will be free.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.22,1:13:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,科莉布索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calypso.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.72,1:13:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.22,1:13:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的称呼很多 你可能不会喜欢这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a name you fancy, I imagine, out of the many that you have…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.89,1:13:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们就这么称呼你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but it is what we call you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.43,1:13:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是指谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We being who?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.37,1:13:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你承认了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You confirm it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.54,1:13:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirm what?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.21,1:13:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你什么都没告诉我 - 是海盗公会 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've told me nothing. - The Brethren Court, not I.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.88,1:14:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一届公会做出的这一决定 我本该反对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The First Brethren Court, whose decision I would have opposed.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.59,1:14:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把你封印在凡人体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}They bound you to human form.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.56,1:14:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,使得海洋的掌握权落在人类的手中 而不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}so the rule of the seas would belong to man and not…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.09,1:14:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌握在我手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.43,1:14:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的原身不应被封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one such as you should never be anything less than what you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.37,1:14:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢统治者的美言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty speech from a captor.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.04,1:14:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你在牢狱外甜言蜜语是不能打动我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But words whispered through prison bars lose their charm.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.38,1:14:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,会因为我的努力而责怪我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I be blamed for my efforts?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.35,1:14:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然危险 世上男人都向往大海\N{\fnArial\fs30}All men are drawn to the sea, perilous though it may be.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.68,1:14:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人把欲望当作开脱罪行的借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}And some men offer desire as justification for their crimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.52,1:14:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是说出我的欲望而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I offer simply my desire.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.53,1:14:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而作为报答呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in return?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.13,1:14:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要你的恩赐 假如你肯赐予的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have your gifts, should you choose to give them.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.14,1:14:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不想赐予呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I should choose not?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.64,1:14:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就接受…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I will take…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.95,1:15:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你的愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your fury.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.77,1:15:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,邵峰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sao Feng?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.64,1:15:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,请过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.18,1:15:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,请过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.52,1:15:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,收齐九枚银币\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all nine pieces of eight…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.52,1:15:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you will be free.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.43,1:15:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.40,1:15:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是船长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are captain now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.40,1:15:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.07,1:16:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,接替我的职位 去沉船湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go in my place to Shipwreck Cove.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.74,1:16:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 船被抢了 我们顶不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain! The ship is taken. We cannot…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.78,1:16:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我 科莉布索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me… Calypso.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.59,1:16:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,邵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sao.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.80,1:16:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对你说什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.57,1:16:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我作船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made me captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.71,1:16:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备 开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.39,1:16:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是我的船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not my captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.69,1:16:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.89,1:16:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}James. James.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.20,1:17:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God, you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.87,1:17:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲见到你平安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father'll be overjoyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.50,1:17:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会很高兴的 - 我父亲已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to know you're safe. - My father's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.80,1:17:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 他回英国了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that can't be true. He returned to England.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.54,1:17:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是贝克特爵士告诉你的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Lord Beckett tell you that?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.78,1:17:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们现在的船长是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who among you do you name as captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.61,1:17:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain. Her.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.18,1:17:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.72,1:17:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.89,1:17:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,把船拖走 把囚犯们关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tow the ship. Put the prisoners in the brig.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.86,1:17:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长住我的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The captain shall have my quarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.40,1:17:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.93,1:17:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我宁愿和我的船员待在一起 - 伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I prefer to remain with my crew. - Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.74,1:17:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.17,1:17:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not know.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.31,1:17:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道什么？你站哪一边？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know what? Which side you chose?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.45,1:17:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在知道了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.89,1:18:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,系带王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bootstrap?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.50,1:18:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,系带王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bootstrap.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.31,1:18:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔·特纳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill Turner?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.68,1:18:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,系带王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bootstrap.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.99,1:18:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my name.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.39,1:18:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我认识你的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.83,1:18:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔·特纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will Turner.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.80,1:18:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}William.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.77,1:18:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他成功了 他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made it. He's alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.34,1:18:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他派你告诉我 他要来救我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he sends you to tell me that he's coming to get me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.55,1:18:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 谢天谢地 他要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's wounds. He's on his way.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.98,1:18:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 威尔还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Will is alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.79,1:19:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很想帮助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he wants to help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.83,1:19:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他帮不了我 他不会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't help me. He won't come.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.23,1:19:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're his father.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.63,1:19:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.23,1:19:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他提起过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He spoke of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.77,1:19:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他救不了我 他是因为你才来不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't save me. He can't come because of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.31,1:19:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.88,1:19:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是伊丽莎白吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.98,1:19:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我是伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.25,1:19:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果琼斯被杀 杀他的人就必须替代他的职位\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Jones be slain, he who slays him must take his place.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.79,1:19:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,作船长 永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain… Forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.53,1:19:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷兰人号总要有一个船长的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dutchman must always have a captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.20,1:19:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he saves me…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.50,1:19:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他便会失去你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he loses you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.34,1:19:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.41,1:20:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会选我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't pick me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.21,1:20:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不会选自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't pick me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.45,1:20:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他别来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him not to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.19,1:20:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他离的远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him to stay away.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.63,1:20:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.23,1:20:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经是船的一部分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm already a part of the ship…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.57,1:20:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,船员的一份子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.37,1:20:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,系带王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bootstrap.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.44,1:20:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my name.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.25,1:20:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my name.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.58,1:20:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我认识你的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.42,1:20:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉\N{\fnArial\fs30}William.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.72,1:20:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来救我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.39,1:20:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.00,1:20:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.73,1:20:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他答应过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He promised.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.92,1:21:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她吊过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swing her over.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.05,1:21:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备绳索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready those lines.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.57,1:21:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.10,1:21:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,刻意留下的标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}A breadcrumb trail.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.04,1:21:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 以便我们顺藤摸瓜 - 他们之中有个叛徒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And we're meant to follow. - A betrayer among them?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.44,1:21:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还是陷阱？- 对手的一步高棋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or a trap? - A gambit by a skilled opponent.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.92,1:21:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 改路线 上尉 - 长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Adjust course, lieutenant. - Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.76,1:21:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望在到达终点时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can only hope to reach our destination.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.09,1:21:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,船上的人不会被杀光\N{\fnArial\fs30}before they run out of bodies.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.77,1:22:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逃出来比我想的还要快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You escaped the brig even quicker than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.78,1:22:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉 你发现什么了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}William, do you notice anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.85,1:22:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rather…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.49,1:22:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现什么不该被发现的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…do you notice something that is not there to be noticed?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.79,1:22:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你并没有通知大家？- 奇怪吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You haven't raised an alarm. - Odd, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.86,1:22:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你这招儿怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not as odd as this.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.73,1:22:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己的主意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come up with this all by your lonesome, did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.26,1:22:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问自己：「杰克这时会怎么做」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said to myself, "Think like Jack."
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.67,1:22:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就想出这招儿了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you've arrived at?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.94,1:22:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,带贝克特爵士到沉船湾 争取他的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead Beckett to Shipwreck Cove so as to gain his trust…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.34,1:22:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后救出你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}…accomplish your own ends?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.24,1:22:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来你完全不了解我嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt's like you don't know me at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.35,1:22:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的亲密爱人对此计划有何感想啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how does your dearly beloved feel about this plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.82,1:22:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.75,1:22:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没告诉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've not seen fit to trust her with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.66,1:23:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要失去她了 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm losing her, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.96,1:23:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离我父亲越近 就离伊丽莎白越远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every step I make for my father is a step away from Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.37,1:23:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你满腔投入 一定会全盘皆输\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you choose to lock your heart away, you'll lose her for certain.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.60,1:23:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来给你指点指点\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I might lend a machete to your intellectual thicket…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.98,1:23:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,置身事外\N{\fnArial\fs30}…avoid the choice altogether.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.78,1:23:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,换个角度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change the facts.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.31,1:23:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个人来干掉琼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let someone else dispatch Jones.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.08,1:23:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.69,1:23:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.03,1:23:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我们换一下就都解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death has a curious way of reshuffling one's priorities.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.50,1:23:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我溜上荷兰人号 找到心脏 捅那个乱跳的东西一刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I slip aboard the Dutchman, find the heart, stab the beating thing,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.10,1:23:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲的债就清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your father's free from his debt,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.94,1:23:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也能和你迷人的小情人一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're free to be with your charming murderess.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.74,1:23:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意切下自己的心脏 把自己和荷兰人号永远绑在一起吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're willing to cut out your heart and bind yourself to the Dutchman…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.64,1:23:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 永远？- 不 伙计 那我就永远自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Forever? - No, mate. I'm free forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.68,1:23:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以自由穿越地图外的海域 没有死亡的束缚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free to sail the seas beyond the edges of the map. Free from death itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.05,1:24:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须得尽责 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to do the job though, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.19,1:24:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得载灵魂去阴间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to ferry souls to the next world.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.89,1:24:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就得像琼斯那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or end up just like Jones.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.56,1:24:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我脸上不适合长触须\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have the face for tentacles.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.40,1:24:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为活人就会有牵挂啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But immortal has to count for something, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.97,1:24:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,要这来干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this for?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.21,1:24:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我的角度出发 你会想到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think like me. It'll come to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.16,1:24:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我向戴维·琼斯问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}My regards to Davy Jones.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.83,1:24:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.87,1:24:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.57,1:24:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.85,1:25:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.79,1:25:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choosing a side.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.35,1:25:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要去沉船湾 贝克特知道海盗公会在那开会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not go to Shipwreck Cove. Beckett knows of the meeting of the Brethren.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.38,1:25:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得那里面有奸细\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear there may be a traitor among them.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.05,1:25:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在才求我原谅太晚了.\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late to earn my forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.42,1:25:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我与你父亲的死毫无关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had nothing to do with your father's death.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.43,1:25:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这不能赎去我以往的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that does not absolve me of my other sins.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.97,1:25:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.11,1:26:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.01,1:26:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.68,1:26:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 我跟着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. I will follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.22,1:26:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在骗人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.62,1:26:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们命运交缠 伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our destinies have been entwined, Elizabeth…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.90,1:26:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但无缘结连理\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but never joined.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.94,1:26:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.61,1:26:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,回你的岗位去 水手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to your station, sailor.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.62,1:26:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人能从船上逃走 - 退下 这是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No one leaves the ship. - Stand down. That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.95,1:26:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.72,1:26:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,船员的一份子 船的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of the crew, part of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.46,1:26:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,船员的一份子 船的一部分 船员的一份子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of the crew, part of the ship. Part of the crew…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.30,1:27:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冷静点 伙计 - 船员的一份子 船的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Steady, man. - Part of the crew, part of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.27,1:27:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意 有人逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}All hands, prisoner escape!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.00,1:27:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 退下 - 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Belay that! - James!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.98,1:27:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prisoner escape!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.52,1:27:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}James! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.26,1:27:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 船长死了 - 船长死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The admiral's dead. - Admiral's dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.13,1:27:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 船长死了 - 船长死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The admiral's dead. - Admiral's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.37,1:27:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去船长舱 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To the captairs cabin! - Aye!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.01,1:27:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,回船上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.98,1:27:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·诺灵顿 你害怕死亡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Norrington. Do you fear death?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.26,1:28:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take that as a "no."
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.83,1:28:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice sword.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.32,1:28:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷兰人号受我指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dutchman is under my command.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.86,1:28:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.94,1:28:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,打起精神 注意观察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look alive and keep a weather eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.07,1:28:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉船岛不是白叫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for naught it's called Shipwreck Island.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.54,1:29:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有沉船湾和沉船镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where lies Shipwreck Cove and the town of Shipwreck.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.05,1:29:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到没有 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard him. Step lively.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.55,1:29:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,都说海盗很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all that pirates are clever clogs,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.95,1:29:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我们在命名上很没想象力\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are unimaginative when it comes to naming things.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.85,1:29:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.16,1:29:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾碰到过个家伙 丢了两只胳膊一只眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I once sailed with a geezer who lost both of his arms and part of his eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.36,1:29:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你管他叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you call him?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.13,1:29:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.07,1:29:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈好的交易我是不会赖帐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not renege on a bargain once struck.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.10,1:29:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我们只定了结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we agreed on ends only.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.17,1:29:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,手段由我来决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}The means are mine to decide.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.21,1:29:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心 巴布萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caution, Barbossa.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.78,1:29:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了是我的力量让你起死回生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not forget it was by my power you return from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.08,1:29:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则结果会如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what it mean if you fail me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.19,1:29:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别忘了你为何救我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you forget why you had to bring me back.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.13,1:29:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不能让杰克 走他该走的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why I could not leave Jack to his well-deserved fate.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.76,1:29:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,九个海盗王合力 才能封印你 科莉布索\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took nine pirate lords to bind you, Calypso.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.83,1:30:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,要解封你至少也要九个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it'll take no less than nine to set you free.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.20,1:30:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,平特尔和瑞盖提船副\N{\fnArial\fs30}Masters Pintel and Ragetti.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.24,1:30:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个卖鱼婆关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this fishwife to the brig.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.18,1:30:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边请 鱼婆小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right this way, Mrs. Fish.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.14,1:30:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是什么杂种狗 任你呼来唤去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot be summoned like some mongrel pup.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.21,1:30:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.68,1:30:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你们认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you know each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.21,1:30:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来当我的船员 特纳船副？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to join my crew again, Master Turner?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.41,1:30:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.22,1:30:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}His.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.32,1:31:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·斯派洛向你问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack Sparrow sends his regards.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.55,1:31:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯派洛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sparrow?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.82,1:31:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell him.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.49,1:31:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从魔狱里 救出了杰克和黑珍珠号\N{\fnArial\fs30}We rescued Jack from the Locker along with the Black Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.50,1:31:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有什么没告诉我的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else have you not told me?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.17,1:31:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个极为棘手的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is an issue far more troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.51,1:31:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你熟悉一个叫科莉布索的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you're familiar with a person called Calypso.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.75,1:31:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a person.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.18,1:31:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是异教的神明\N{\fnArial\fs30}A heathen god.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.32,1:31:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以最狂野的梦想来 诅咒男人们 并以此为乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}One who delights in cursing men with their wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.92,1:31:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后戳穿梦想 只剩 空洞虚无和灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then revealing them to be hollow and naught but ash.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.32,1:31:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这世界已经摆脱她了 - 其实没全摆脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The world is well rid of her. - Not quite so well, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.36,1:31:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗公会正打算释放她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Brethren Court intends to release her.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.76,1:31:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！他们不能！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! They cannot!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.63,1:31:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一届公会答应永远囚禁她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The First Court promised to imprison her forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.67,1:31:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是我们的约定 - 你们的约定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was our agreement. - Your agreement?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.17,1:32:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉他们如何封印她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I showed them how to bind her.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.24,1:32:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不可信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could not be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.28,1:32:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她…让我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… She gave me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.68,1:32:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须赶在他们释放她之前动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must act before they release her.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.69,1:32:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You loved her.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.69,1:32:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是你情人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the one.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.72,1:32:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你背叛了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you betrayed her.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.79,1:32:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她假装爱过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She pretended to love me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.66,1:32:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她背叛了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.27,1:32:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道 哪次背叛之后 你切出了自己的心？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after which betrayal did you cut out your heart, I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.08,1:32:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要惹我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not test me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.85,1:32:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没喝完\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hadrt finished that.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.58,1:32:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会释放我父亲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will free my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.42,1:32:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要保证伊丽莎白的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will guarantee Elizabeth's safety.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.95,1:32:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.62,1:32:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要求不低 特纳先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your terms are steep, Mr. Turner.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.26,1:32:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要等价的回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will expect fair value in return.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.46,1:32:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只接受一个价钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is only one price I will accept:
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.47,1:32:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了科莉布索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calypso murdered.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.44,1:33:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,科莉布索在黑珍珠号上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calypso's aboard the Black Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.84,1:33:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克驾黑珍珠号去了沉船湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack has sailed the Black Pearl to Shipwreck Cove.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.25,1:33:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在不在那船上 又打算如何领我们去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with you no longer aboard her, how do you propose to lead us there?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.33,1:33:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最想要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you want most?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.83,1:34:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看它们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.47,1:34:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这辈子还没有这样的集会\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not been a gathering like this in our lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.37,1:34:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我欠了他们一身债\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I owe them all money.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.78,1:34:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为会议召集人\N{\fnArial\fs30}As he who issued summons,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.31,1:34:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宣布第四届海盗公会开幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I convene this, the Fourth Brethren Court.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.96,1:34:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了证实你们的身份和权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}To confirm your lordship and right to be heard,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.53,1:34:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,请出示西班牙银币 诸位船长们\N{\fnArial\fs30}present now your pieces of eight, my fellow cap'ns.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.41,1:34:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这哪是西班牙银币 这是一堆破烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those aren't pieces of eight. They're just pieces of junk.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.68,1:34:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 本来是要用九块 西班牙银币来封印科莉布索的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye. The original plan was to use nine pieces of eight to bind Calypso.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.48,1:34:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但第一届公会开会时 人人都穷得要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when the First Court met, the Brethren were to a one skint broke.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.52,1:34:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那改改名字吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So change the name.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.79,1:35:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 要叫「当时我们 口袋里随便什么零碎」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To "nine pieces of whatever we happened to have in our pockets at the time?"
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.06,1:35:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 那倒是很海盗化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. That sounds very piratey.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.03,1:35:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞盖提船副 请了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Ragetti, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.33,1:35:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会替你保管好的 就像你给我时说的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kept it safe, just like you said when you gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.40,1:35:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说过 现在我要拿回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, you have. But now I need it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.38,1:35:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯派洛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.58,1:35:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要指出我们还少一个海盗王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might I point out that we are still short one pirate lord,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.29,1:35:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以等着邵峰来 一点都不急\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm as content as a cucumber to wait until Sao Feng joins us.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.32,1:35:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,邵峰死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sao Feng is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.06,1:35:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死于飞翔的荷兰人号之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fell to the Flying Dutchman.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.40,1:35:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条灾难之船！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plagued ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.77,1:35:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让你当船长了？船长的头衔他们就这样拱手送人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made you captain? They're giving the bloody title away now.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.24,1:35:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 送他们下地狱！- 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Que lo manden al diablo! - Listen. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.27,1:35:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的位置被出卖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our location has been betrayed.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.58,1:35:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯受贝克特勋爵指挥 正朝这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jones is under the command of Lord Beckett. They're on their way here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.28,1:35:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁是叛徒？- 不太可能是我们当中的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is this betrayer? - Not likely anyone among us.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.35,1:36:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 威尔在哪里？- 不在我们当中\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Will? - Not among us.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.45,1:36:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题不是他们怎么找到的 问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It matters not how they found us. The question is,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.25,1:36:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}what will we do now that they have?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.82,1:36:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.40,1:36:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉船湾是个堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shipwreck Cove is a fortress.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.90,1:36:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个给养充足的堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}A well-supplied fortress.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.30,1:36:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们攻不进来 我们就不必战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no need to fight if they cannot get to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.87,1:36:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能还有第三条出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}There be a third course.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.48,1:36:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个时代 就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In another age, at this very spot,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.98,1:36:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一届海盗公会抓住了女海神 将她封印起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}the First Brethren Court captured the sea goddess and bound her in her bones.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.22,1:36:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.66,1:36:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确 我们驯服海洋为己所用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we tamed the seas for ourselves, aye.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.40,1:36:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,却为贝克特和他的同党打开了大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}But opened the door to Beckett and his ilk.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.50,1:36:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前更美好的日子里 控制海洋不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better were the days when mastery of seas.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.00,1:36:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠与可怖的怪物做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}came not from bargains struck with eldritch creatures,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.91,1:37:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是靠额头的汗水 凭自己的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}but from the sweat of a mars brow and the strength of his back alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.35,1:37:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都知道这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all know this to be true.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.01,1:37:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.48,1:37:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.29,1:37:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要解封科莉布索\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must free Calypso.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.30,1:37:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开枪打他 - 切舌头！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shoot him. - Cut out his tongue!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.80,1:37:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,打他 然后切舌头 再打舌头 剪了他乱七八糟的胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot him, cut out his tongue, then shoot his tongue. And trim that beard.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.77,1:37:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邵峰会赞同巴布萨的 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sao Feng would've agreed with Barbossa. - Ay.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.38,1:37:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,科莉布索那时是我们的敌人 现在还会是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calypso was our enemy then, she will be our enemy now.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.35,1:37:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的脾气暴躁 现在也不可能变好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unlikely her mood's improved.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.35,1:37:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赞同邵峰 放了科莉布索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would still agree with Sao Feng. We release Calypso.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.25,1:37:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你威胁我？- 你给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You threaten me? - I silence you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.43,1:38:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是疯狂 - 这是政治\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is madness. - This is politics.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.67,1:38:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,与此同时敌人正向 我们压过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, our enemies are bearing down upon us.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.34,1:38:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定已经到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they not be here already.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.08,1:38:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sweet.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.75,1:38:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来救我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.85,1:38:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在等着我来 - 被困在这个躯体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were expecting me. - It has been torture.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.89,1:38:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一种折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trapped in this single form.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.66,1:39:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,被切断了与海的联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut off from the sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.50,1:39:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我所爱的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}From all that I love.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.37,1:39:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}From you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.47,1:39:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你交付的任务工作了十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten years I devoted to the duty you charged to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.38,1:39:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我照顾了那些海上死者十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten years I looked after those who died at sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.45,1:39:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们终于可以在一起时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, finally, when we could be together again…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.79,1:39:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你没去\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you werert there.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.99,1:39:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么没去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why werert you there?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.00,1:39:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的天性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt's my nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.83,1:39:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不是我 你还会爱我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you love me if I was anything but what I am?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.61,1:39:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.91,1:39:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有很多个性 戴维·琼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many things you were, Davy Jones.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.69,1:39:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但从不残酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}But never cruel.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.65,1:40:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经背叛了你的初衷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have corrupted your purpose…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.99,1:40:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,背叛了你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and so your self.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.66,1:40:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经属于我的东西 已经被你藏起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you did hide away what should always have been mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.42,1:40:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,科莉布索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calypso.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.53,1:40:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会自由的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be free.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.33,1:40:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我会给你我的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I am, I would give you my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.80,1:40:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会永远在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we would be together always.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.44,1:40:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那时你有心相爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only you had a heart to give.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.58,1:40:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you come?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.93,1:41:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给囚禁你的人们 准备了什么样的命运？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what fate have you planned for your captors?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.51,1:41:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗公会？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Brethren Court?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.48,1:41:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们临死前会明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them, the last thing they will learn in this life…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.35,1:41:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以变得多残酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is how cruel I can be.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.62,1:41:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你的命运呢？戴维·琼斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of your fate, Davy Jones?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.56,1:41:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的心永远属于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart will always belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.44,1:42:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一届公会囚禁了科莉布索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt was the First Court what imprisoned Calypso.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.31,1:42:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这届应该放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be the ones to set her free.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.68,1:42:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了感谢我们 她会给我们好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in her gratitude, she will see fit to grant us boons.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.09,1:42:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁的好处？你的好处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose boons? Your boons?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.62,1:42:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说全是骗人的废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Utterly deceptive twaddle-speak, says I.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.69,1:42:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有更好的主意 请共享出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have a better alternative, please, share.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.37,1:42:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuttlefish.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.60,1:42:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.64,1:42:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的朋友们 让我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us not, dear friends,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.34,1:42:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要忘记亲爱的乌贼朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}forget our dear friends, the cuttlefish.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.88,1:42:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,滑腻腻的小香肠们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flipping glorious little sausages.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.15,1:42:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,把两个乌贼放一块 它们会 毫不犹豫地自相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pen them up together, they'll devour each other without a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.18,1:42:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,人的本性 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human nature, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.52,1:42:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是…鱼的本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or… Or fish nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.62,1:42:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以躲在这里 给养充足武备齐全\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yes, we could hole up here well-provisioned and well-armed.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.42,1:42:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一个月内会死一半人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half of us would be dead within the month.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.66,1:42:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么看结局都很悲观 或者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which seems quite grim to me, any way you slice it. Or…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.54,1:43:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者像我们有才的同事 天真地建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}As my learned colleague so naively suggests,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.37,1:43:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们放了科莉布索 然后寄希望于她的怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can release Calypso, and we can pray that she will be merciful.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.88,1:43:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我很怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rather doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.95,1:43:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以假装她绝不是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we pretend she's anything other than a woman scorned.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.02,1:43:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,怒火满腔的女人吗？我们不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}like which fury hell hath no? We cannot.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.06,1:43:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,事物自道缘由 一旦将她放归大海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Res ipsa loquitur, tabula in naufragio.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.39,1:43:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只剩一个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are left with but one option.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.23,1:43:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意…我不敢相信我正说这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree with, and I cannot believe the words are coming out of me mouth…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.40,1:43:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯旺船长 我们必须战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Captain Swann. We must fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.41,1:43:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你总是逃避战斗 - 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've always run away from a fight. - Have not.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.71,1:43:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有 - 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have so. - Have not.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.91,1:43:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有 - 我没有！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have so. - Have not!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.11,1:43:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有 你自己知道 - 没有 造谣中伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have so, and you know it. - Have not. Slander and calumny.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.35,1:43:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是遵循最古老 最神圣的海盗传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have only ever embraced that oldest and noblest of pirate traditions.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.72,1:43:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,此时此刻我建议 我们都应该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I submit that here now that is what we all must do:
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.99,1:43:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must fight…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.16,1:43:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,以便逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to run away.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.73,1:43:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 对！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aye! - Aye!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.83,1:44:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗法典规定 战争 就是现在的情形\N{\fnArial\fs30}As per the code, an act of war, and this be exactly that,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.34,1:44:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能由海盗大帝来宣布\N{\fnArial\fs30}can only be declared by the pirate king.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.31,1:44:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你编的 - 我编的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You made that up. - Did I, now?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.94,1:44:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有请法典的保管人蒂格船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call on Cap'n Teague, keeper of the code.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.48,1:44:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,松巴吉爵士宣布这全是假的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sri Sumbhajee proclaims this all to be folly!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.55,1:44:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的海盗法典 谁在乎…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang the code. Who cares a…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.06,1:44:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,法典至高无上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code is the law.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.91,1:44:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你挡我道了 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in my way, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.12,1:44:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 法典 - 法典\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The code. - The code.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.82,1:45:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,由摩根和巴多罗米尔制定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As set forth by Morgan and Bartholomew.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.11,1:45:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不可能…这怎么… - 海龟 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That can't… How did… - Sea turtles, mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.95,1:45:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,海龟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sea turtles.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.23,1:45:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 巴布萨是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Barbossa is right.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.00,1:45:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.97,1:45:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗大帝的责任是宣战\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Lt shall be the duties, as the king,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.01,1:45:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及与共同的敌人进行谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}to declare war, parley with shared adversaries…"
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.54,1:45:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fancy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.61,1:45:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,自第一届以来就没有海盗大帝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has not been a king since the First Court.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.15,1:45:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在也不太可能会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's not likely to change.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.88,1:46:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不太可能 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not likely. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.05,1:46:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗大帝是由海盗王们公选出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, the pirate king is elected by popular vote.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.75,1:46:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有海盗都只会选他自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And each pirate only ever votes for hisself.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.32,1:46:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提议投票\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call for a vote.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.23,1:46:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我投安曼海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I vote for Ammand the corsair.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.67,1:46:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,法国穷光蛋夏威尔船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capitaine Chevalle, the penniless Frenchman.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.60,1:46:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,松巴吉爵士投松巴吉爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sri Sumbhajee votes for Sri Sumbhajee.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.17,1:46:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,清夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistress Ching.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.18,1:46:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,久卡德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentleman Jocard.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.28,1:46:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊丽莎白·斯旺 - 巴布萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Elizabeth Swann. - Barbossa.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.91,1:46:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,维基勒巴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vallenueva!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.52,1:46:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白·斯旺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth Swann.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.88,1:46:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我知道 很好奇吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I know. Curious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.36,1:46:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,投票选我 投票选我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vote for me. Vote for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.46,1:46:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么呀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.93,1:46:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.10,1:46:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你们的投票不打算遵循海盗法典？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I to understand that you lot will not be keeping to the code, then?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.61,1:46:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.06,1:47:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯旺船长 海盗大帝 你要下什么命令？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What say you, Captain Swann, king of the Brethren Court?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.03,1:47:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备所有的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare every vessel that floats.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.20,1:47:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,黎明时\N{\fnArial\fs30}At dawn…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.94,1:47:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we're at war.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.94,1:47:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们将开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so we shall go to war.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.23,1:47:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.20,1:47:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都见过 什么都做过了 你活下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen it all, done it all. You survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.53,1:47:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有要诀吧？为了生存？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the trick, isn't it? To survive?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.94,1:47:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,目的不在于永远活着 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt's not just about living forever, Jackie.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.34,1:47:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要诀是永远活出自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trick is living with yourself forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.49,1:48:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Mum?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.59,1:48:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看来气色很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looks great.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.55,1:48:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人来了！消灭他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The enemy is here! Let's take them!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.51,1:49:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,弃船！弃船！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abandon ship. Abandon ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.96,1:49:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈判？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parley?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.91,1:50:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来是你这杂种引狼入室\N{\fnArial\fs30}You be the cur that led these wolves to our door.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.62,1:50:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要怪特纳 他不过是被利用的工具而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't blame Turner. He was merely the tool of your betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.89,1:50:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要找主谋 往你左边看\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wish to see its grand architect, look to your left.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.83,1:50:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没插手过这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hands are clean in this.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.57,1:50:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figuratively.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.27,1:50:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我自己的选择 我有自己的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My actions were my own and to my own purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.80,1:50:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟杰克没关系 - 说得好 听听工具怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jack had nothing to do with it. - Well spoke. Listen to the tool.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.31,1:50:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔 我上过荷兰人号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will, I've been aboard the Dutchman.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.21,1:50:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你的目的和重担 但恐怕那已经毫无意义了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand the burden you bear, but I fear that cause is lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.38,1:50:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有一个傻瓜留下来战斗 就不会没有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}No cause is lost if there is but one fool left to fight for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.49,1:50:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果特纳不是为你效劳 他怎么会给我这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Turner wasrt acting on your behalf, then how did he come to give me this?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.59,1:51:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克你我有交易 把所有海盗送到我手上 现在他们都到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made a deal with me, Jack, to deliver the pirates. And here they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.33,1:51:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害臊 尽管上来领赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be bashful. Step up. Claim your reward.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.77,1:51:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欠我的帐还是要还的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your debt to me is still to be satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.74,1:51:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在荷兰人号上服务一百年 这是起码的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hundred years in servitude aboard the Dutchman. As a start.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.38,1:51:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,欠账已经还了 在她的帮助下\N{\fnArial\fs30}That debt was paid, mate. With some help.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.68,1:51:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你逃跑了 - 严格来讲…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You escaped. - Technically.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.15,1:51:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议交换人质\N{\fnArial\fs30}I propose an exchange.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.29,1:51:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔跟我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will leaves with us…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.89,1:51:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以带走杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and you can take Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.76,1:51:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.43,1:51:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 取消 - 成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Undone. - Done.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.20,1:51:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克是九大海盗王之一 你没有权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack's one of the nine pirate lords. You have no right.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.80,1:51:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是海盗大帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}King.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.77,1:51:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听从您的命令 陛下 - 蠢才！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- As you command, your nibs. - Blackguard!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.05,1:51:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如果有什么想说的 我也有要说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lf ye have something to say, I might be saying something as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.42,1:51:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看谁先到终点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}First to the finish, then?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.74,1:52:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怕死吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you fear death?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.85,1:52:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.55,1:52:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬告你的海盗们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Advise your Brethren,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.49,1:52:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以战斗 但都会被消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can fight, and all of you will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.66,1:52:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不战斗 你们大部分人会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you can not fight, in which case only most of you will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.76,1:52:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你谋杀了我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You murdered my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.23,1:52:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自己选择的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}He chose his own fate.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.87,1:52:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也选择了你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have chosen yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.67,1:52:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.34,1:52:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.95,1:52:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So be it.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.59,1:53:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,大帝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}King?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.02,1:53:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗公会的 如杰克所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of the Brethren Court. Courtesy of Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.36,1:53:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他真的知道自己想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he really does know what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.14,1:53:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.17,1:53:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成功登上了飞翔荷兰人号 正如计划的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've successfully arrived aboard the Dutchman as per the overall scheme.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.44,1:53:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看 - 是的 帽子 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look - Oh, yes. Chapeau, mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.24,1:53:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,除去被关在牢里这部分 好像有点出乎意料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for this sojourn in the brig, it's utter clockwork.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.58,1:53:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.82,1:53:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？回到魔狱去？- 不能没有你 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What, back to the Locker? - Not without you, Jackie.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.82,1:53:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,扎心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stab the heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.79,1:53:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为荷兰人号的船长永生不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live forever as captain of the Flying Dutchman.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.74,1:53:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then again…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.17,1:53:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在牢里\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you're in the brig…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.37,1:54:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁应该扎心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who's to stab the heart?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.88,1:54:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在离不死之身 好像有点远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does seem to put immortality a bit out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.48,1:54:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！花生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peanut.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.22,1:54:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要让黑珍珠号 作为旗舰领头攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll need to use the Black Pearl as a flagship to lead the attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.55,1:54:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要嘛？- 好吧 鱼女士 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, will we now? - All right, Mrs. Fish. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.32,1:54:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴布萨 你不能释放她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barbossa, you can't release her.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.83,1:54:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要给杰克一个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to give Jack a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.33,1:54:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 陛下 我的命运 不在我自己手中已经太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, Your Majesty. Too long my fate has not been in me own hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.14,1:54:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.44,1:54:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The enemy…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.31,1:54:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择了毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has opted for oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.78,1:54:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让舰队准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready the fleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.65,1:54:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各就各位！- 各就各位！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To your stations. - To your stations.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.86,1:54:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,要些仪式咒语什么的嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be there some manner of rite or incantation?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.10,1:54:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.80,1:55:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,物件全凑齐 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The items brought together, done.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.14,1:55:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧掉物件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Items to be burned…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.21,1:55:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后有人必须说\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and someone must speak the words:
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.44,1:55:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,「科莉布索 我把你从躯体里释放出来」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Calypso, I release you from your human bonds."
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.01,1:55:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.58,1:55:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要用对爱人讲话的口吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Tis said it must be spoken as if to a lover.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.49,1:55:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,科莉布索 我把你从躯体里释放出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calypso, I release you from your human bonds!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.37,1:55:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这样了？- 不不 他说的不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that it? - No, no, no. He didn't say it right.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.38,1:55:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.88,1:55:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你要亲切点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to say it right.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.36,1:55:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,科莉布索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calypso…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.73,1:56:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你从躯体里释放出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I release you from your human bonds.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.75,1:56:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,提亚·朵玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tia Dalma.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.89,1:56:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,科莉布索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calypso.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.69,1:56:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗公会禁锢你的时候 是谁告诉他们这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the Brethren Court imprisoned you, who was it that told them how?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.30,1:56:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁背叛了你 - 说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who was it that betrayed you? - Name him.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.47,1:56:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴维·琼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Davy Jones.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.25,1:57:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是了！这就是了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it! This is it!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.70,1:57:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,科莉布索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calypso!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.67,1:57:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我作为仆人跪在你面前 虔卑而懊悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come before you as but a servant, humble and contrite.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.71,1:58:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完成了我的誓约 我现在请求你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have fulfilled me vow and now ask your favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.62,1:58:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,放过我 我的船和我船员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spare meself, me ship, me crew…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.02,1:58:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,将你的愤怒发泄于那些 敢于自命为你的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but unleash your fury upon those who dare pretend themselves your masters…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.99,1:58:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,或我的主人的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.09,1:59:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.09,1:59:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一点忙都没帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, she's no help at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.80,1:59:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.00,1:59:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也不干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.07,1:59:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后的希望也落空了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our final hope has failed us.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.46,2:00:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还没完 - 战斗还在前头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not over. - There's still a fight to be had.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.53,2:00:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要对付整个舰队 还有荷兰人号 没希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've an armada against us, and with the Dutchman, there's no chance.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.54,2:00:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻人或许有傻福\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only a fool's chance.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.91,2:00:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇也救不回你父亲 斯旺小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge won't bring your father back, Miss Swann,
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.74,2:00:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不打算为此送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's not something I'm intending to die for.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.99,2:00:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.86,2:00:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们为何送命？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what shall we die for?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.53,2:00:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们给我听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.67,2:00:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.87,2:00:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗们还在看着我们 等着黑珍珠号领队\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Brethren will still be looking here to us, to the Black Pearl, to lead.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.51,2:00:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会看到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what will they see?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.45,2:00:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊恐的鼠辈？被弃的破船？不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frightened bilge rats aboard a derelict ship? No.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.85,2:00:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他们会看到自由的人和自由！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they will see free men and freedom!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.15,2:00:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人会听见我们的炮声\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what the enemy will see is the flash of our cannons.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.66,2:01:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见我们拔剑出鞘 看到我们的气势\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will hear the ring of our swords, and they will know what we can do.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.60,2:01:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我们额头上的汗水\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the sweat of our brows,
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.97,2:01:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们脊背的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the strength of our backs…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.70,2:01:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们心中的勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the courage of our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.41,2:01:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.61,2:01:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,升起旗帜\N{\fnArial\fs30}…hoist the colors.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.12,2:01:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,升起旗帜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hoist the colors.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.62,2:01:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 升起旗帜 - 升起旗帜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hoist the colors. - Hoist the colors!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:26.99,2:01:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.12,2:01:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 风向对我们有利\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wind's on our side, boys. That's all we need!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.76,2:01:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,升起旗帜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hoist the colors!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.91,2:02:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 风向对我们有利\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a favorable wind, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.85,2:02:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此甚好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so we do.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.69,2:02:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知琼斯 不留活口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signal Jones to give no quarter.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.69,2:02:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会给他这一天增加亮点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should brighten his day.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.70,2:02:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器就位！我们不留活口\N{\fnArial\fs30}To arms! We give no quarter!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.88,2:02:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,科莉布索！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calypso.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.30,2:03:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你注意到没 这么多事 现在又下雨了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you noticed, on top of everything, it's raining?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.31,2:03:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个坏兆头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a bad sign.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.44,2:03:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌住绞盘 用力 加把劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man the capstan. Raise the main topyard. Keep that powder dry.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.99,2:03:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,大漩涡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maelstrom!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.03,2:03:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴布萨船长！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Barbossa!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.00,2:03:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要你去掌舵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you at the helm.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.54,2:04:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, that be true.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.21,2:04:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,升起帆桁 你们这些 蠢货吊猿人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brace up yards, you cack-handed deck apes.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.42,2:04:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,要死也死得痛快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dying is the day won'th living for.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.63,2:04:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,转向！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Veer off!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.33,2:04:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她无法消灭我们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll not harm us.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.10,2:04:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,全力驶入深渊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full-bore and into the abyss.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.14,2:04:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you mad?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.54,2:04:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 你怕湿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha! You afraid to get wet?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.05,2:04:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在往船艉靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's on our stern and gaining.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.49,2:04:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,掉头迎风前进 不要惧怕！\N{\fnArial\fs30}More speed! Haul your wind and hold your water.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.03,2:05:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下火炮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bow cannons!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.94,2:05:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,开炮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blow the cannons!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:17.28,2:05:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,把船开出去 否则它会压倒我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take us out or they'll overbear us.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.25,2:05:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 再进深些 我们会切入较快的水流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nay. Further in. We'll cut across to faster waters.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.36,2:05:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备接舷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare to broadside.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.91,2:05:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备火炮 帮帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain the guns. Bear a hand.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.24,2:05:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼓起勇气 随时待发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Muster your courage, men. At the ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.25,2:05:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,象幼兽一样思考 象幼兽一样思考 象幼兽一样思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think like the whelp. Think like the whelp. Think like the whelp.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.92,2:05:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,铰链 铰链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hinges. Hinges.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.19,2:05:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,象幼兽一样思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think like the whelp.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.56,2:06:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,半桶铰链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half-barrel hinges.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.09,2:06:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,杠杆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leverage.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:07.37,2:06:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝我好运吧 我们需要好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish us luck, boys. We'll need it.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.07,2:06:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我已经开始想他了 - 他好有魅力 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I miss him already. - He is quite charming, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.97,2:06:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody move.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:16.61,2:06:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脑子掉出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dropped me brain.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:28.25,2:06:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,封舱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batten down the hatches!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.33,2:06:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,推出火炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand to your guns.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:34.93,2:06:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,船中炮手 瞄准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Midship cannoneers, sight the masts.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.67,2:06:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,主炮就绪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Main battery at the ready!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:48.67,2:06:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住！等到船舷对齐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold there! Wait till we're board-and-board.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.52,2:06:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.62,2:07:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开火！- 开火！全部开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fire! - Fire! Fire all!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.89,2:07:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.93,2:07:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:21.07,2:07:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 大伙们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, men.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:32.55,2:07:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在转向已经太晚了 船员们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It be too late to alter course now, mateys.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.56,2:07:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动！否则我们会开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halt there or we'll shoot.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:45.30,2:07:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good one.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.90,2:07:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是来拿我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just come to get me effects.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.54,2:07:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你们的行为值得尊敬 但为何你们要待在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admirable though it may be, why are you here when you could be elsewhere?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.81,2:07:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须有人看管宝箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone has to stay and guard the chest.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:00.55,2:08:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 最近这船上的军纪越来越涣散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no question, there's a breakdown in military discipline on this vessel.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.18,2:08:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪那些鱼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I blame the fish people.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:06.92,2:08:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你的意思是 鱼人本性就一定散漫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so fish people, by dint of being fish people,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:11.36,2:08:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不象那些非鱼人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}automatically aren't as disciplined as non-fish people?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.66,2:08:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是说 他们做出了贡献\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems contributory, is all I'm suggesting.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.10,2:08:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 如果没有那些鱼人 根本就不用看管宝箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true, if there were no fish people, there'd be no need to guard the chest.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:22.07,2:08:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且如果没有宝箱 我们也不用看管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if there were no chest we wouldn't need to be here to guard it.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.05,2:08:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备登船！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare to board!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.72,2:08:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找掩护！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.57,2:08:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.23,2:09:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看哪 孩子们 一只迷途之鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lookee here, boys. A lost bird.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:27.27,2:09:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只从未学会飞行的雏鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lost bird that never learned to fly.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.47,2:09:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}To my great regret.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:35.54,2:09:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.41,2:09:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,学习从来不嫌晚 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…never too late to learn, eh?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:57.70,2:10:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,箱子…拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chest, hand it over.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:01.10,2:10:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以释放你 还你自由 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can set you free, mate.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.00,2:10:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很久前就放弃自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My freedOm WaS fOrfeit IOng agO.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:53.09,2:10:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:58.19,2:10:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:00.46,2:11:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意嫁给我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:03.63,2:11:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在求婚不妥吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think now's the best time.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:09.27,2:11:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这恐怕是我最后的机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now may be the only time.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.54,2:11:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.68,2:11:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我主意已定 你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made my choice. What's yours?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.05,2:11:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴布萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barbossa.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:29.82,2:11:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我们证婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marry us.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:32.36,2:11:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在有点忙！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little busy at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.23,2:11:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴布萨 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barbossa, now.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:44.90,2:11:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:57.12,2:12:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的各位 我们今天聚集在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dearly beloved, we be gathered here today…
Dialogue: 0,2:12:00.95,2:12:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你喉咙钉到桅杆上 你个杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}To nail your gizzards to the mast, you poxy cur.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:09.36,2:12:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白·斯旺 你愿意接受我成为你的丈夫吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth Swann, do you take me to be your husband?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:12.46,2:12:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我愿意 - 棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I do. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:20.91,2:12:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔·特纳…你愿意…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will Turner, do you take me…
Dialogue: 0,2:12:24.44,2:12:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,娶我为妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to be your wife…
Dialogue: 0,2:12:30.58,2:12:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论生病或健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in sickness and in health…
Dialogue: 0,2:12:33.45,2:12:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,健康的可能性比较小\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with health being the less likely?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:42.90,2:12:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.40,2:12:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,以船长的身分 我现在宣布你们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As captain, I now pronounce you…
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.27,2:12:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以亲吻…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may kiss…
Dialogue: 0,2:13:02.98,2:13:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以亲吻…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may kiss…
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.39,2:13:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快亲吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just kiss.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.76,2:13:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:03.68,2:14:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没钥匙的话也没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do nothing without the key.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:06.41,2:14:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经有钥匙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already have the key.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:09.15,2:14:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:12.08,2:14:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 那把钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that key.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:49.46,2:14:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:17.52,2:15:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oi. My pistol.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:47.71,2:15:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,特钠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turner.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:54.12,2:15:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:01.06,2:16:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:32.46,2:16:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下！是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Lt's me.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:36.50,2:16:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是威尔 你儿子呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Will. Your son.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:08.19,2:17:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:40.53,2:17:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,去呀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:00.41,2:18:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,女海盗！我也不会手下留情的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harridan! You'll see no mercy from me.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:04.55,2:18:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才带了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I brought this.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:26.30,2:18:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会杀你的 我答应过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to kill you. I made you a promise.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:38.15,2:18:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没打中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missed.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:40.69,2:18:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否忘记了？我是没心脏的可怜人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you forget? I'm a heartless wretch.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:02.11,2:19:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Love.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:05.78,2:19:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怕的牵绊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dreadful bond.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:10.05,2:19:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却也容易切割\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, so easily severed.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:15.12,2:19:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 威廉·特纳 你怕死吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, William Turner, do you fear death?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:20.39,2:19:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:32.57,2:19:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是美妙的结合 掌中同时把握着爱与死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heady tonic, holding life and death in the palm of one's hand.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:36.88,2:19:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真残忍 杰克·斯派洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a cruel man, Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:42.15,2:19:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否残忍要看个人出发点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruel is a matter of perspective.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:45.15,2:19:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:12.48,2:20:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:15.21,2:20:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 清醒点 你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me! Stay with me! You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:23.69,2:20:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}William?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:25.79,2:20:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:39.37,2:20:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔 看着我 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will? Will? Look at me. Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:46.58,2:20:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你阻止我的判决\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not forestall my judgment.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:06.26,2:21:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,科莉布索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calypso.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:13.77,2:21:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要把我们拉下去了！把两条船分开 不然大家都下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's taking us down! Make quick or it's the Locker for us all!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:50.21,2:21:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:55.38,2:21:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:56.95,2:21:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:59.95,2:22:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,船员的一份子 船的一部份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of the crew. Part of the ship, part of the crew.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:04.32,2:22:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,船员的一份子 船的一部份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of the ship, part of the crew.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:07.89,2:22:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别离开我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:11.23,2:22:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别离开我！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't. No!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:13.00,2:22:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会离开你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't leave you.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:24.98,2:22:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷兰人号必须要有一个船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dutchman must have a captain.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:30.52,2:22:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:26.24,2:23:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank goodness, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:27.97,2:23:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌方舰队还在那里 「努力号」快速地朝右舷而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The armada's still out there. The Endeavor's coming up hard to starboard,
Dialogue: 0,2:23:32.01,2:23:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候发扬海盗的 最古老 最荣耀的传统了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think it's time we embrace that oldest and noblest of pirate traditions.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:36.18,2:23:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一向不尊照传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never actually been one for tradition.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:43.79,2:23:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,升帆 转舵 下锚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close haul her. Luff the sails and lay her in irons.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:46.89,2:23:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听他的 否则我们会成瓮中之鳖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belay that, or we'll be a sitting duck.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:49.23,2:23:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听他那句「别听他的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belay that "belay that."
Dialogue: 0,2:23:50.63,2:23:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但船长 - 别听他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But the arma… - Belay.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:52.50,2:23:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的努… - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Endeav… - Stow. Shut it.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:07.85,2:24:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在等什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:10.85,2:24:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他期望我们履行我们的合约\N{\fnArial\fs30}He expects us to honor our agreement.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:15.99,2:24:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好枪和炮门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready guns and gun ports.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:22.56,2:24:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并非针对你 杰克 只不过这是桩好交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing personal, Jack. It's just good business.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:54.33,2:24:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 她还健在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, she survived.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:21.95,2:25:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把炮准备好 - 把炮准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready on the guns. - Guns ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:25.96,2:25:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,升帆！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full canvas.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:28.19,2:25:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,升帆！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, full canvas.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:55.09,2:25:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,请下令 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orders, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:59.86,2:26:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:01.63,2:26:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cap'n.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:03.06,2:26:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开火 - 开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fire. - Fire!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:05.76,2:26:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开火！- 开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fire! - Fire!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:07.90,2:26:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire, all!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:20.45,2:26:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,请下令 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orders? Orders, sir?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:35.73,2:26:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 请下令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, what do you command?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:37.83,2:26:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt's just…
Dialogue: 0,2:26:41.27,2:26:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过是桩好交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}…good business.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:44.67,2:26:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,弃船！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abandon ship!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:46.07,2:26:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弃船！- 全体人员 弃船！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Abandon ship! - All hands, abandon ship!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:15.86,2:28:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们撤退了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're turning away!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:29.94,2:28:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一帆风顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wind in your sails.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:37.05,2:28:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓老子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shiver me timbers.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:00.10,2:29:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,特纳船长！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Turner!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:16.82,2:29:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吉伯斯先生 - 船长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Gibbs. - Cap'n?
Dialogue: 0,2:29:20.12,2:29:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你愿意的话 可以丢我的帽子 - 好的 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You may throw my hat if you like. - Aye, aye, cap'n.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:23.19,2:29:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,万岁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:27.13,2:29:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go and get it.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:47.32,2:29:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,请下令 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orders, sir?
Dialogue: 0,2:29:53.19,2:29:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经不被荷兰人号束缚了 你自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're no longer bound to the Dutchman. You're free.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:57.30,2:29:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:59.36,2:30:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是好事 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a fine thing, but…
Dialogue: 0,2:30:03.37,2:30:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我还有一样债未还\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by my reckoning, I still have a debt that has to be paid.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:08.14,2:30:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你容许的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll have me.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:13.78,2:30:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,去掌舵吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the wheel, then, Mr. Turner.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:17.01,2:30:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 特纳船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, Captain Turner.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:33.97,2:30:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘船有了新的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ship has a purpose again.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:36.70,2:30:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要前往的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where we are bound…
Dialogue: 0,2:30:39.40,2:30:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不能跟来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…she cannot come.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:41.94,2:30:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一天上岸\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day ashore.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:43.98,2:30:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,十年航海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten years at sea.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:47.04,2:30:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是非常沉重的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a steep price for what's been done.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:52.05,2:30:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要看上岸那天值不值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends on the one day.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:56.82,2:30:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的座驾准备好了 殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your chariot awaits, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:03.19,2:31:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,船桨在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The oars are inside.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:16.81,2:31:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,特纳夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Turner.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:23.68,2:31:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 妞妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, poppet.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:31.06,2:31:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:33.59,2:31:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之间永远不会有结果的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would never have worked out between us.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:39.46,2:31:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你继续说服你自己吧 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep telling yourself that, darling.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:45.37,2:31:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once was quite enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:49.64,2:31:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:10.96,2:32:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要另一只\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to need the other one.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:44.96,2:32:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳快下山了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nearly sunset.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:06.12,2:33:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一直都属于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt's always belonged to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:13.59,2:33:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能好好保管它吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you keep it safe?
Dialogue: 0,2:33:16.96,2:33:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:22.13,2:33:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:43.15,2:33:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:59.74,2:34:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着海平面等我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep a weather eye on the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:30.77,2:34:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然它倾向左舷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granted it tends to list to port, and has been, on occasion,
Dialogue: 0,2:34:34.14,2:34:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且有时会吓坏女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}known to frighten young women.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:36.44,2:34:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我保证 你们不会失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I promise you, you will not be disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:41.51,2:34:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,2:34:43.25,2:34:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑珍珠？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Black Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:45.42,2:34:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不大呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not very big.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:47.59,2:34:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜心 那是条小艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love, that is a dinghy.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:50.05,2:34:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的船非常宏伟、凶猛、巨大…而且…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My vessel is magnificent and fierce and huge-ish and…
Dialogue: 0,2:34:55.89,2:34:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见了 怎么会不见了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…gone. Why is it gone?
Dialogue: 0,2:34:59.96,2:35:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是那艘？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it there?
Dialogue: 0,2:35:02.77,2:35:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 正是那艘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:04.90,2:35:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会在那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it there?
Dialogue: 0,2:35:07.51,2:35:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,近看的话大很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt's much larger up close.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:09.14,2:35:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 你答应带我们去兜风的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, you promised to take us for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:11.58,2:35:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我本来应该是第一个上船的 - 什么 你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was to be given the first ride. - What? You?
Dialogue: 0,2:35:15.58,2:35:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不是这么说的 - 我绝不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not what he said. - I never!
Dialogue: 0,2:35:19.98,2:35:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉伯斯先生 为什么我的船不见了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gibbs? Any particular reason why my ship is gone?
Dialogue: 0,2:35:24.19,2:35:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,船？我们在船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ship? We're on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:29.66,2:35:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 船不见了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack! The ship's gone!
Dialogue: 0,2:35:32.60,2:35:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,2:35:35.70,2:35:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 能不能闭嘴？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies! Will you please shut it?
Dialogue: 0,2:35:39.04,2:35:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 是的 我骗了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. Yes, I lied to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:42.47,2:35:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不爱你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:44.04,2:35:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然让你看起来很胖 我没去过布鲁塞尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it makes you look fat. I've never been to Brussels.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:47.21,2:35:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,发音是「极…坏…的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is pronounced "egregious."
Dialogue: 0,2:35:50.01,2:35:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未见过比萨罗 但我很喜欢他的派\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, no, I've never actually met Pizarro, but I love his pies.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:54.12,2:35:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都不重要 因为我的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all of this pales to utter insignificance.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:56.89,2:36:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一次不见了 懂了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}in light of the fact that my ship is once again gone. Savvy?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:13.17,2:36:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿走你能拿的 - 一点都不放过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take what you can. - Give nothing back.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:20.01,2:36:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 女士们 你们对海龟了解多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, ladies, what do you know of sea turtles?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:24.12,2:36:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,海龟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sea turtles?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:25.48,2:36:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说说激动人心的船长故事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you the amazing story of Cap…
Dialogue: 0,2:36:27.79,2:36:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都上梯绳\N{\fnArial\fs30}All men up the ratlines.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:30.86,2:36:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都上梯绳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All men up the ratlines!
Dialogue: 0,2:36:38.80,2:36:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想尝尝这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you want a taste of this?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:42.53,2:36:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子 你真是个乖孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's a good boy! You're Daddy's boy.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:45.80,2:36:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是的 你是好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, you are. Oh, yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:48.51,2:36:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:50.88,2:36:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些船员觉得不该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of the men don't feel entirely settled.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:53.48,2:36:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丢下杰克 - 又一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}- about leaving Captain Jack behind. - Again.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:56.11,2:36:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又一次 - 是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Again. - Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:59.28,2:37:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能让我们看看你所说的宝藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt would make us feel a whole lot better regarding our fortunes.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:03.02,2:37:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会安心许多\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we could see that item you told us about.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:05.79,2:37:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在航海图上的方位 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On the charts. - Aye.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:08.06,2:37:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们亲眼看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}With our own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:09.53,2:37:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可以帮助我们减轻罪恶感\N{\fnArial\fs30}To help put an ease to our burden of guilt, so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:13.56,2:37:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:15.47,2:37:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,睁大眼好好瞧瞧吧 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feast your eyes upon this, mateys.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:18.10,2:37:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,长生不老不是只有一种方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more than one way to live forever.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:20.70,2:37:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,男士们 见识一下不老泉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gents, I give you the Fountain of Youth.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:35.22,2:37:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯派洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:37.59,2:37:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 呦吼 呦吼 我的海盗生涯 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Yo ho, yo ho A pirate's life for me ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:38:08.05,2:38:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是恶魔 是害群之马 地地道道的大坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're devils and black sheep Really bad eggs.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:31.78,2:38:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 喝干这杯 无忧也无愁 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Drink up, me hearties Yo ho ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:47:06.82,2:47:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 呦吼 呦吼 我的海盗生涯 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Yo ho, yo ho A pirate's life for me ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:47:11.76,2:47:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们杀人越货 我们无恶不作 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We pillage, we plunder We rifle and loot ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:47:14.93,2:47:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 喝干这杯 无忧也无愁 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Drink up, me hearties Yo ho ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:47:16.80,2:47:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们绑架掳掠 我们无恶不作 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We kidnap and ravage And don't give a hoot ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:47:19.50,2:47:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 喝干这杯 无忧也无愁 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Drink up, me hearties Yo ho ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:47:21.41,2:47:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 呦吼 呦吼 我的海盗生涯 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Yo ho, yo ho A pirate's life for me ∮
